<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndongwa nofu kota hila fyo tsandikwe na Matayo, cho chitabu chimwe mu fitabu fitayi fya lilagano lya sambi fyo fin'dadambula ndongwa tsa wumi wa Yesu Chilisito. Chila chimwe chinchemwa, Chitabu Ndongwa Nofu. Chinya kutijila Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu. Fitabu fino fya Matayo na Maliko na Lukasi hamwe na Yohana fyandikwe hala Yesu hoavaga mwanga afweye. Vanu vasomi sivantsela chitabu chino cho chandikwe na Matayo kuta chandikwe hanili. Lechelelo yikuva nachene kuta chandikwe mwaka gwa 60 kuhuma kuleleka kwa Yesu Chilisito. Chinu chinji cho sivan'tsela sivahatsele hono hala ho akandichilye, lechelelo vanu vanji vantijila kuta akandichilye ku inyi ya Palesitina na awu ku muji gwa Yelusalemu. Mwandisi va chitabu chino yo Matayo, yo avaga mukongotsa kodi hala ho avaga ang'acha kuva mudahitswa va Yesu. Litawa linji lya Matayo achemwaga Lavi. Matayo avaga yumwe va vala vatumi kumi na vavili va Yesu, ndongwa tsa chitabu chino avandichilye vasomi va Chiyawudi. Lulongwa luno lunlajila kuta muna ndongwa 60 na kulutila tsotsihumye mu Mandiko ga Lilagano lya Katali. Matayo aganaga kulajila kuta Yesu yo Masiya na Mukulusi yo ahagulwe na Mulungu, na kuta valoli va Mulungu vavaga valontsile ndongwa tsake. Kaha Matayo andiche ndongwa ntsolofu tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. Vayawudi vihuvilaga kuta Masiya ave muntsajila va wutavala wa mu inyi. Lechelelo Matayo eletselaga ndongwa itso tebe na hila fyo vahotsaga, kwa kuweletsela Wuntsajila wa chi Muhe wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndongwa Nofu kota hila fyo tsandikwe na Matayo, cho chitabu cho chimfwaya chive chilongola mu fitabu fya lilagano lya sambi, kwasawuli china ndongwa ntsolofu tsotsili mu fitabu fya lilagano lya katali. Ichino cho chitabu cho chinkong'asa malagano gavili. Vanu wo vasomile vanlonga kuta nambe Matayo avaga an'jela kwiga kwandika kota fyo yandikwe mu fila fitabu fihanu fya Musa, fyo filongola mu lilagano lya katali. Mbikulo tsa Yesu hala hoavaga ku chidunda, mu Matayo wuwoneko wa 5-7 wihwana na hila Mulungu fyo amupelye Musa malajitso mu chitabu cha Lilagano lya Katali.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="io">1. Matayo ankwantsa mu chitabu chino kwa kutsidadambula ndongwa tsa kuleleka kwa Yesu Chilisito na hila fyo antsitse kukola katsi. Mu Matayo wuwoneko wa 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Kaha an'dadambula ndongwa tso adisile Yesu na madahitso gake molofu. Mu Matayo wuwoneko wa 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Hono ha wudugo wa Ndongwa Nofu kota hila fyo tsandikwe na Matayo hanlajila lulongwa lukomi ndalahela lwa kufwa na kutsilipuka kwa Yesu. Mu Matayo wuwoneko wa 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Chilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Lukasi 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Igano go matawa ga lukolo lwa Yesu Chilisito, yo avaga va lukolo lwa Dawudi, na yo avaga va lukolo lwa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibulahimu amuletsile Yisaka nayo Yisaka amuletsile Yakobo, na Yakobo amuletsile Yuda hamwe na vang'olotse. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda amuletsile Pelesi na Tsela, nayo yuvawo achemwaga Tamali, Pelesi amuletsile Hetsiloni, nayo Hetsiloni amuletsile Alamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alamu amuletsile Aminadabu, nayo Aminadabu amuletsile Nasoni, nayo Nasoni amuletsile Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni amuletsile Bowatsi na yuve va Bowatsi achemwaga Lahabu, Bowatsi amuletsile Obedi kwa Mudala vake yo achemwaga Luti, nayo Obedi amuletsile Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese amuletsile Dawudi yoavaga muntsajila. Nayo Dawudi amuletsile Solomoni, na yuve va Solomoni achemwaga Batiseba yo avaga mudala va Huliya, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni amuletsile Lehobohamu, Nayo Lehabohamu amuletsile Abiya, nayo Abiya amuletsile Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa amuletsile Yehosafati, nayo Yehosafati amuletsile Yolamu, nayo Yolamu amuletsile Hutsiya. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Hutsiya amuletsile Yotamu, nayo Yotamu amuletsile Ahatsi, nayo Ahatsi amuletsile Hetsechiya. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hetsechiya amuletsile Manatse, nayo Manatse amuletsile Amoni, nayo Amoni amuletsile Yosia. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia amuletsile Yekoniya hamwe na vang'olotse chipindi cha chihamo cha Babeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Vayahudi ho vavaga kuhamitsilwa kuluhamo ku inyi ya Babeli, Yekonia amuletsile Sealitiyeli, nayo Sealitiyeli amuletsile Tselubabeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Tselubabeli amuletsile Abiwudi, nayo Abiwudi amuletsile Eliyachimu, nayo Eliyachimu amuletsile Atsoli. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Atsoli amuletsile Sadochi, nayo Sadochi amuletsile Achimu, nayo Achimu amuletsile Heliyudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliyudi amuletsile Heliyatsali, nayo Eliyatsali amuletsile Matani, nayo Matani amuletsile Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo amuletsile Yusufu, uyuno Yusufu yo avaga mulume va Maliyamu, na Maliyamu yo yuve va Yesu yo anchemwa Chilisito. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Ihyo kwavaga na filelo kumi na fitayi kuhuma Ibulahimu mbaka Dawudi, na kaha kwavaga na filelo kumi na fitayi kuhuma Dawudi mbaka kuluhamo lwa Babeli, na filelo kumi na fitayi kuhuma luhamo lwa Babeli mbaka hala ho avaga kuleleka Yesu Chilisito.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuleleka kwa Yesu Chilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Lukasi 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Kuleleka kwa Yesu Chilisito kwavaga hino. Maliyamu yuve va Yesu, avaga akwelilwe na Yusufu, Lechelelo ho avaga ang'ali kutolwa na Yusufu, Maliyamu akawonekaje ana wubofu kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Kwasawuli Yusufu avaga munu yo an'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, si aganaga kumuhonjela nyoni Maliyamu, akahotsaje kumuleka kwa lufiho. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Lechelelo Yusufu ho avaga anhotsa lulongwa ulo, mutantsi va Mutwa akamuhumilaje mu mbilo na kumulonjela, “Yusufu mwana va Dawudi, ulekaje kuva na muloto kumutola Maliyamu ave mudala vako. Kwasawuli wubofu wo anawo apasile kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Nayo akulela mwana mulume, na heve ukumutambulila litawa lyake Yesu, kwasawuli mwene yo akuvagombola vanu vake vahume mu ndongwa tsawo ntsibi.” <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ndongwa itso tseka tsahumye ili lukwile lulongwa lo alontsile Mutwa kukolela kwa muloli va Mulungu kuta, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Lave, Muhintsa yo ang'ali kuvasa na mulume, akupata wubofu nayo akulela mwana mulume, na vanu vakumuchema litawa lyake Manweli” Chinya kutijila, “Mulungu ali hamwe na hetwe.” <verse eid="MAT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Yusufu ho avaga kulamuka, akaditaje kota hila fyo alajitswe na mutantsi va Mutwa, akamutolaje Maliyamu ave mudala vake. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Lechelelo Yusufu siavasise na Maliyamu, mbaka hala Maliyamu ho aletsile mwana mukwamitsi, nayo Yusufu akamutambulilaje mwana yula litawa lyake, “Yesu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Vanu vanya ntselo tsa nyenyetsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Iho Yesu ho avaga kuleleka ku muji gwa Beselehemu ya Wuyawudi, chipindi cha wutavala wa muntsajila Helode, luvala lulo mwana hoavaga kuleleka, vanu vanya ntselo tsa nyenyetsi wo vahumye lubali lwa kuwuhumilo wa litsuva, vakafikaje ku muji gwa Yelusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Vakaputsaje kuta, “Mbe, alikwiya yo aleliche, yo muntsajila va Vayawudi? Kwasawuli tuyiwene nyenyetsi yake lubali lwa kuwuhumilo wa litsuva, na hetwe tutsitse kumuhonamila.” <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ihyo Muntsajila Helode ho avaga kuhulika lulongwa ulo, mwene hamwe na vanu veka va ku Yelusalemu vakavaje na mahotso ndala hela. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Muntsajila Helode akavachemaje vavina va vatawula nambiko hamwe na vadahitsi va malagitso ga Musa, akavaputsaje, “Chilisito akuleleka kwiya?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Nawo vakamulonjelaje, “Ku muji gwa Beselehemu ya Wuyawudi,” kota hila fyo andiche muloli va Mulungu kuta,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Heve, Muji gwa Beselehemu, mu inyi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Heve siuli mudodo ndaya, ku miji jojintambulwa ja Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">kwasawuli kukolela kwa heve</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">akuhumila mutavala yo akuvalongotsa vanu vangu va Isilaheli.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ihyo Helode akavachemaje kwa lufiho vala vanyantselo tsa nyenyetsi, aganaga atsele nachene, chipindi cho yikawoniche nyenyetsi yila. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Kaha akavatumaje vabite ku muji gwa Beselehemu, akavalonjelaje, “Mubite mukahime finofu ndongwa tsa mwana uyo, manyi mumuwone, mutse mundonjele ili na heni mbite ngamuhonamile.” <verse eid="MAT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Vala vanyantselo tsa nyenyetsi hovavaga kumuhulikitsa muntsajila Helode, vakawukaje, na yila nyenyetsi yovavaga vayiwene lubali lwa wuhumilo wa litsuva, yikavalongolaje mbaka hono hala ho aleliche mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Vavaga kuyiwona nyenyetsi yila, vakahechelelaje ndala hela. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Vakinjilaje mu nyumba, vakamuwonaje mwana hamwe na Maliyamu yuve, vakamuhonamilaje mwana. Kahi vakagubulaje fifunje fyawo na kutawula madini ga tsahabu, wubani hamwe na madini ga fwetsa. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Nawo ho vavaga kufundwa na Mulungu kukolela mu mbilo kuta valeche kuwuya kwa muntsajila Helode, vakawuyaje kwawo kukolela ng'asi yinji.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu, na Maliyamu na Yesu vam'bilimila kuinyi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Vanu iwo ho vavaga kuwuka, mutantsi va Mutwa akamuhumilaje Yusufu mu mbilo, akamulonjelaje, “Winuche, Mutole mwanago hamwe na yuve, muchimbilile kuinyi ya Misili, mukikale kuko mbaka ho ngukulonjela muwuye, kwasawuli muntsajila Helode an'gana kumukopola uyo mwana.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Ihyo Yusufu akalamukaje, akamutegulaje mwana hamwe na yuve kung'acha kutitu titu, vakabitaje kuinyi ya Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />vakikalaje kuko mbaka ho avaga kufwa muntsajila Helode. Ndongwa itsi tsikahumye ili lukwile lulongwa lo alontsile Mutwa kukolela kwa muloli va Mulungu kuta, “Ngamuchemile mwanangu, kuhuma kuinyi ya Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukopolwa kwa vana vadodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helode ho avaga kuwona hila vala vanya ntselo tsa nyenyetsi fyo vamudetelitse, akavipaje ndala hela. Akavalajitsaje vanu vabite mu muji gwa Beselehemu na hono heka habehi na iho, vakavakopole vana veka vakwamitsi vanya myaka jivili na wo vali hasika ha myaka ijo. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ihino ho tsikakwilye ndongwa tso alontsile Yelemiya muloli va Mulungu kuta,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Munu ahulikwe anvemba ku muji gwa Lama, chivembo chikomi na ng'ung'uto, Laheli anguvavembela vanage, na alema kuhongetswa, kwasawuli vafyeye.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu an'wuya kuhuma ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Hambele ho avaga kufwa Helode, mutantsi va kilanga va Mutwa akamuhumilaje Yusufu mu mbilo kuko kuinyi ya Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />akamulonjelaje, “Umutole mwana hamwe na yuve muwuche, muwuye kuinyi ya Isilaheli, kwasawuli yovaganije kumukopola mwana vafweye.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Ihyo, Yusufu akawukaje, akamutolaje mwana hamwe na yuve, vakawuyaje kuinyi ya Isilaheli. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Lechelelo Yusufu ho avaga kuhulika kuta, Alechilawo aveye muntsajila va Wuyahudi badili ya Helode dade. Akogopaje kubita uko kwasawuli avaga afunditwe mu mbilo, nayo akabitaje ku Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />akikalaje kuko ku muji go gwachemwaga Natsaleti. Ihyo lukakwilaje lulongwa lo valontsile valoli va Mulungu kuta, “Akuchemwa Munatsaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ndongwa nofu tso avikwe Yohana Mubatitsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lukasi 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Ihyo ho avaga Yohana mubatitsi kuhumila, avaga anvikula Ndongwa Nofu mu mbuga ya Wuyawudi na kulonga, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Mupituche na kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi, kwasawuli wuntsajila wa Mulungu wuli habehi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Uyuno yo Yohana yoyuyo Isaya muloli va Mulungu alontsile ndongwa tsake, Muhulikitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Munu anchema kuhuma ku mbuga kuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">mumuwuyapile Mutwa ng'asi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Na mwiviche chang'ani kumwanuchila Mutwa ho akuva atsitse.”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohana mwene avaga afwite nyingo ya ngamiya hamwe na musipi gwa nyingo, na chilyo chake chavaga ntsije hamwe na wuchi. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Vanu kuhuma kumuji gwa Yelusalemu na kuinyi yeka ya Wuyahudi, hamwe na inyi tseka tsotsili habehi na lulenga lwa Yolidani, vakabitaje kwa Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Nawo vakamupituchilaje Mulungu na kutsileka ndongwa tsawo ntsibi, nayo Yohana akawabatitsaje mu lulenga lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="MAT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Yohana hoavaga kuvawona Vafwalisayo hamwe na Vasadukayo vankutsa ili avabatitse, akavaputsaje, “Henye chilelo cha ntsoka, nani yo avalonje muyibilime atsabu ya Mulungu yoyinkutsa? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Ihyo muditaje ndongwa nofu kulajila kuta, mulesile ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Mulekaje kuhotsa mu numbula tsenyu na kulonga kuta, hetwe tuna Dada vetu yo Ibulahimu, kwasawuli ntsinguvalonjela kuta Mulungu afuluche amupele Ibulahimu vana kuhuma mu maganga gano. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Lelo vega mwanga yivisilwe mu ndela tsa mibichi, chila mubichi go sinambe gulele mibawo gukudumulwa na kutotswa mu moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Heni ntsinguvabatitsa kwa malenga kwasawuli ya kumupituchila Mulungu, lechelelo mwene yo ankutsa kuhuma kumbele kwangu ana wuvetso kundutila heni, na heni sifuluche nambe ntsifilejetse filatu fyake, mwene akuvabatitsa kwa Muhe va Mulungu na u moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Mwene mwanga ana luhelo lwa kupetela mu mawoko gake, nayo akufyajila luga lwa kubetela filyo, wuhemba akuwuvika mwidoga, na misuyo jeka akujinyanya mu moto go sikutsimaga.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu am'batitswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lukasi 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Chipindi icho Yesu akawukaje kuhuma kumuji gwa Galilaya, akafikaje mbaka ku lulenga lwa Yolidani, ili abatitswe na Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Lechelelo Yohana akamulonjelaje, “Heni ntsin'ganika kubatitswa na heve, heve unkutsa kwaheni? <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Lechelelo Yesu akamulonjelaje, widichile sambi, kwasawuli kukolela hino tun'ganika kudita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu.” Ihyo Yohana akidichilaje. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Luvala lulo Yesu hoavaga kubatitswa akahumaje mululenga, simusika kilanga kukadindukaje nayo akamuwonaje Muhe va Mulungu, ankwika kwa wuwoneko kota wa ng'unda akimaje mwilanga mwake. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Luvala lulo litsi likahulikwaje kuhuma kilanga, “Yuno yo Mwanangu mwendi yo an'ngan'ya heni.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu an'jlwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Lukasi 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Kahi Yesu akalongotswaje na Muhe va Mulungu, kubita ku mbuga ili ajelwe na Lihoka. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Yesu afuntsile siku alubayini hamunyi na hachilo amusukaga Mulungu, hambele akawonaje ntsala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Lisetani likatsaje na kumulonjela, “Manyi heve uli Mwana va Mulungu, ugadite maganga gano gave mabumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Lechelelo Yesu akalilonjelaje Lisetani kuta yandikwe, “Munu siafuluche ave na wumi kwa kulya chilyo ng'ani, ila kwa chila lulongwa lo lunhuma kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Kahi lisetani likamusindikaje Yesu mbaka ku Nyumba ya Mulungu ku Yelusalemu, likamuvikaje Yesu hilanga ha munala gwa Nyumba ya Mulungu na likamulonjelaje, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />“Manyi heve uli Mwana va Mulungu witotse hasi, kwasawuli yandikwe kuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Mulungu akuvalajitsa vatantsi vake va kilanga vakutole mu mawoko gawo ili uleche kikuvala mu liganga.”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu akamulonjelaje yandikwe kaha, “Walahogola kumujela Mutwa Mulungu vako.”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Kahi Lisetani likamutolaje Yesu mbaka mwilanga mwa chidunda chitali na kumulajila wuntsajila wake weka wa mu inyi na finu fyake vinofu. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Kahi Lisetani likamulonjelaje Yesu, “Manyi unyonamile na kufugamila ngukupela finu ifi fyeka.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yesu akalilonjelaje, wuche halutalo hangu heve lisetani! Kwasawuli yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu, umufugamile Mutwa Mulungu vako, nave umutumichile mwene ng'ani. <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ihyo lisetani likamulekaje Yesu, na vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu vakatsaje kumutanga.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankwantsa kuvikula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lukasi 4:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu hoavaga kuhulika kuta Yohana mubatitsi ali mu nyumba ya wuwopwa, akabitaje ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Akahumaje ku Natsaleti, akabitaje kikala ku Kapelinawumu, muji goguli habehi na bahali ya Galilaya, mumbaka tsa miji ja Tsabuloni na Nafutali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />adisile ihyo ili lukwile lulongwa lo alontsile Yisaya muloli va Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Inyi ya Tsabuloni na inyi ya Nafutali, kung'asi ya kubitila ku bahali kumwambu gwa lulenga lwa Yolidani, na Galilaya ko vangikala vanu wo si Vayahudi! <verse eid="MAT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Vanu vala wo vangikala mu jitsa vaguwene mwangatsa mukomi, nawo vala wo vichite mu inyi yinya mujiji gwa chifo, mwangatsa guvangatsilye.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuhuma luvala ulo Yesu antsitse kuvikula kwa kulonga, “Mumupituchile Mulungu na kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi, kwasawuli wuntsajila wa Kilanga wuli habehi!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvachema valova somba vatayi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lukasi 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu ho ajendaga mulubali lwa lilamba lya Galilaya, akavawonaje vanu vavili wo vavaga lukolo, Simoni yo achemwaga litawa linji Petulo, na mung'olotse yo achemwaga Andeleya. Iwo vavaga vantotsa nyafu tsawo mu lilamba. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mutse mufwate na heni nguvadita muve munguvaleta vanu kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Luvala lulo vakalekaje nyafu tsawo wakamufwataje Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Kuhuma iho Yesu akabitaje kutalo, akavawonaje vanyalukolo vanji vavili Yakobo na Yohana yo vana va Tsebedayo, vavaga vichite mu mutumbwi hamwe na dadawo vawuyapaga nyafu tsawo, Yesu akavachemaje, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />nawo vakagulekaje mutumbwi na dadawo, wakamufwataje Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dahitsa na kuvaponetsa vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Lukasi 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu akabitaje ku inyi yeka ya Galilaya, adahitsaga mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayahudi na kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa wuntsajila wa Mulungu, na kuvaponetsa vanu namwa tsa chila ayina. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Ndongwa tsake tsikatagalilaje mu fijiji fyeka fya Samu, nawo vanu vakamuletelaje vatamwa veka vanya namwa tsa chila ayina na vanya ng'odeko, na vanya misoka, na vanya chintsilisa, na wovapotsile mivili, veka akavaponetsaje. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Malugu ga vanu wakamufwataje Yesu, kuhuma ku Galilaya na ku Dekapoli, na ku Yelusalemu, na ku Wuyahudi na ku mwambu gwa lulenga lwa Yolidani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu adahitsa vanu kuchidunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 5:1-7:29">Lukasi 5:1-7:29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ihyo Yesu hoavaga kuliwona lilugu lya vanu lingumufwata, akakwinaje kuchidunda na akikalisaje hasi, nawo vadahitswa vake vakatsaje hala hoali. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Kahi akantsaje kudahitsa,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wusangalo wa wukweli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Lukasi 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Vaditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu vanu vala wo vangumuhuvila Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">Kwasawuli Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wukuva wawo.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Vaditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu vanu vanya wususutalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">Kwasawuli iwo vakuhongetswa.”<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />“Vaditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu vanu vanya wudeche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">Kwasawuli iwo vakupelwa inyi na Mulungu yive yawo.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Vaditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu vanu iwo wovan'gana kudita ndongwa tsa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">Kwasawuli Mulungu akuvatanga kudita ihyo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />“Vaditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu vanu vanya lusungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">Kwasawuli iwo vakuhulumilwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Vaditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu vanu vanya numbula tso tsilihela wubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">Kwasawuli iwo vakumuwona Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />“Vaditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu vanu wo vanleta wusichimafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">Kwasawuli iwo vakuchemwa vana va Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Vaditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu vanu wo vankodwa, kwasawuli ya kudita hila fyo an'gana Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">Kwasawuli Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wukuva wawo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Mutambichilwe henye yo munligwa, na kukodwa, na kulongwa fibi na vanu, kwasawuli ya heni. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Musangalalaje na kuhechelela, kwasawuli chifunje chenyu chikuva chikomi kilanga kwa Mulungu. Kwasawuli hohihyo fyo vavaditye valoli va Mulungu va katali.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwino na mwangatsa.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Lukasi 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Henye muna kota mwino kwa vanu va mu inyi, lechelelo mwino manyi guyatse lwiha lwake gukusopwa chichi mbaka gufwaye? Sigukufwaya kanji lechelelo gutagwaga kivala na kukanyagwa na vanu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Henye yo mwangatsa gwa inyi kota Nyumba yoyitsentsilwe ha chidunda siyifuluche yileche kuwoneka. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Vanu sivasaga koloboyi na kuyivika muchibogonyela, lechelelo vasaga na kuyivika ha chibogonyela ili yivang'alichile vanu veka wo vali munyumba iyo.” <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Ihyo henye mun'ganika muve kota mwangatsa go gunguvang'alichila vanu, ili vanu manyi vatsiwone ndongwa tsenyu nofu tsomun'dita, vamutsumitse Dada venyu va Kilanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvadahitsa vanu malajitso ga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Mwalahogola muhotse kuta ntsitsitse kubadila malajitso ga Musa na ndongwa tsa valoli va Mulungu, sintsitsitse kutsihetsa lechelelo ntsitsitse kuvalonjela kuta, madahitso igo goga wukweli. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, mbaka hala kilanga kwa Mulungu na inyi ho fikulutila, kuduhu nambe malajitso gogave ga Musa awu hono hadodo ho hakuhetswa mbaka fyeka fikwile. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Munu yo yuve yo akulema kwichila kudita nambe lulongwa ludodo lwa malajitso ga Mulungu, na kuvadahitsa vanu vanji valeche kudita ihyo, munu uyo akuchemwa mudodo nachene mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. Lechelelo munu yo yuve yo akudita malajitso ga Mulungu na kugadahitsa, akuchemwa muvina ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Kaha ntsinguvalonjela kuta, manyi kudita kwenyu kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, sinambe kulutile kota fyo van'dita vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Vafwalisayo, nachene simu kwinjila ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dahitsa madahitso ga ndongwa tsa mbipo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Lukasi 12:57-59</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mwahuliche vanu va katali vavalonje kuta mwalahogola kumukopola munu yoyuve, na munu yo akukopola akuhigwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Lechelelo heni ntsinguvalonjela, munu yoyuve yo akumuvipila mung'olotse an'ganika kuhigwa, na yo akumubedala mung'olotse na kumuwona siali chinu akusindikwa ku wuhigo. Lechelelo munu yo akumuchema mung'olotse, heve uli mupufi ukotolwe, uyo an'ganika kuhigwa abite ku Jehanamu ya moto. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ihyo manyi unsindika chitambichilwa hono ha matsabahu na kuno unkwiwuka kuta, mukosine na mung'olotso, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />uchileche chitambichilwa chako ha matsabahu, na ubite tandi ukapatane tandi na mung'olotse, iho ho uwuye ukatawule chitambichilwa chako.”<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Mupatane na mutelani vako tandi, homukuva muli mung'asi kubita kwa muhigaji. Nayo muhigaji akukusindika kwa mwimilitsi, nayo mwimilitsi akukusindika kwa muvina va vimilitsi va nyumba ya vawopwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Wukweli ntsinguvalonjela kuta, siukuhuma umo mbaka uhombe sendi ya wudugo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga ndongwa tsa waafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />Yesu akendelelaje kulonga “Muhuliche vanu vakatali valontsile kuta, walahogola kivasa na mudala au mulume yosi vako. <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Lechelelo heni ntsinguvalonjela, chila munu yo akumulava mudala yoyuve kwa mbwiniwo, akuva mwanga avasise nayo mu numbula yake. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ihyo manyi liho lyako lya kwilililo lingukwambutsa udite wubi, ulihetse na kulitaga kutali, kwasawuli yikuva chiba uve ulihela chilungo chimwe mu muvili gwako, kuliko muvili gwako gweka gutotswe mu Jehanamu ya moto. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Manyi liwoko lyako lya kwi lililo lingukwambutsa udite wubi, liteme na kulitotsa kutali na heve, kwasawuli yikuva chiba uve wulihela chilungo chimwe mu muvili gwako, kuliko muvili gwako gweka gutotswe mu Jehanamu ya moto.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga talaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lukasi 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Kaha yalontsilwe kuta, manyi munu yoyuve yo an'gana kumuleka mudala vake amwandichilaje baluva ya kwileka. <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Lechelelo heni ntsinkuvalonjela kuta, chila munu yo akumuleka mudala vake kwa chambutso cha kivasa na munu yunji, angumudita mudala vake ave mwaafu, na munu yoyuve yo akumutola mudala uyo akuva mwaafu.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga kilaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Muhuliche vanu va katali fyovalonjeliwea, mulekaje kilaha kwa wudesi, lechelelo manyi wilahe kwa Mutwa Mulungu uditaje kota fyo ulontsile. <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Lechelelo heni ntsinkuvalonjela kuta, mwalahogola kudita wilaho wowuve ho muku vangilaha, wala kilaha kwa lulanga, kwasawuli uko kuna chigoda cha Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />awu kwa inyi, kwasawuli inyi ho hono ha kuvichila magulu gake, wala mulekaje kwilaha kwa muji gwa Yelusalemu, kwasawuli ugo go muji gwa Muntsajila Muvina. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Yesu akendelelaje kulonga, kaha mulekaje kilaha kwa mutwi gwako, kwasawuli simukuvetsa kudita nambe fwili yimwe yive ntselu awu nitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Lechelelo ndonga yenyu yivaje kweli, manyi ndaya yivaje ndaya, kwasawuli ndongwa tso tsinlutila iho tsinhuma kwa lila Lihoka.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsa wupilulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Lukasi 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Yesu akendelelaje kulonga muhuliche kaha yalontsilwe kuta, “Liho kwa liho na lino kwa lino.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Lechelelo heni ntsinguvalonjela kuta, mulekaje kusumwana na munu yo an'dita wubi, Lechelelo ma munu akutove lutsetse lililo, heve mupituchile lya kavili. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Na munu yo akugana akuhije, na kutegula mugolole gwako, heve mupele na likoti. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Kaha manyi munu akukukobaditsa lujendo lwa maili yimwe, heve ujende nayo maili tsivili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Chila munu yo akukusuka, mupelaje, na munu yo akugana kukopa, mukopetsaje.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvagana vatelani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Lukasi 6:27-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />Muhuliche kaha, muvaganaje vanu va habehi na umuvipilaje mutelani vako. <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Lechelelo heni ntsinkuvalonjela kuta, muvaganaje vatelani venyu, na kaha muvasuchilaje vala yovanguvaditila wubi, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Manyi mudite ihyo, nachene mukuva vana va Dada venyu va kilanga kwa Mulungu. Kwasawuli mwene anguvangatsila litsuva vanu veka yo van'dita wuwuya na wubi, kaha anguvatonyela ndonya vanu veka yo van'dita wuwuya na wubi. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Kuduhu chifunje chochive cho mukupa manyi muvagane vala yo munguvagana, kwasawuli nambe vakongotsa kodi vaditaga hisho. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Manyi henye munguvasamusa vang'olotsenyu ngani, mbe, mun'dita chinu chachi kuvalutila vanu vanji? Kwasawuli na vanu yo sinambe vamutumbile Mulungu van'dita hihyo. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Ihyo mun'ganika muve mugaya ndongwa tsibi tsotsive kota Dada venyu va Kilanga kwa Mulungu fyo ali.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dahitsa ndongwa tsa kuvatanga vanu vanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Yesu akendelelaje kulonga, “Mwiyangalilaje, mulekaje kudita wuwuya wenyu hamiho ga vanu ili vavalole, kwasawuli manyi mudite ihyo simukupelwa chifunje na Dada va Kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Ihyo ho munguvatanga vanu vanji mulekaje kutangatsa kota fyo vaditaga vanu vapunganitsi, mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi kwa kugana kutsumilwa na vanu. Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta iwo mwanga vanuchilye chifunje. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Lechelelo henye manyi mungumutanga chinu munu mugayu, muditaje ihyo nambe munu vako va habehi alekaje kutsela. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Ihyo lulongwa ulo lukuva lufiho kwako, na Dada vako yo alolaga cho udisile kulufiho, akukuditila wuwuya.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dahitsa ndongwa tsa kusuka Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Lukasi 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Henye ho mukuva munsala, mulekaje kuva kota vanu vapunganitsi, kwasawuli vene vaganaga kusala kuno vimile mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi awu mulubali lwa ng'asi ili vilajile kwa vanu. Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta vene mwanga vapasile chifunje chawo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Lechelelo heve ho ukuva unsala, winjilaje mu chumba chako na udindaje lwitsi, iho ho umusuche Dada vako yoali kulufiho, na mwene yo alolaga kulufiho akukupela chifunje chako.” <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Henye ho mukuva munsuka, mulekaje kuvana ndongwa tsolofu go gigaya mana kota vanu wosiva mutsele Mulungu vaditaga ihyo, kwasawuli vene vahotsaga kuta suko yinya isho yikuhulikwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Lelo mulekaje kuva kota iwo, kwasawuli Dada venyu an'tsela cho mun'gana hala henye mung'acha simulasuka. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Henye mun'ganika kusuka hino, Dada vetu va Kilanga, Litawa lyako litsumitswe, <verse eid="MAT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Wuntsajila wako wutse, choun'gana chiditwe mu inyi kota uko kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Utupele munyiguno chilyo chetu cha chila siku. <verse eid="MAT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Utuhulumile ndongwa ntsibi getu kota hetwe fyo tunguvahulumila vala wo vatukosye. <verse eid="MAT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ulekaje kutwingitsa mu munjelo, lechelelo utukuluse kuhuma kwa lila Lihoka. Kwasawuli Wuntsajila wo waheve na mamulaka, na wumelemo wuna heve siku tseka tsotsigaya wudugo.” Tavile.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Kwasawuli manyi muvahulumile vanu yo vanguvaditila makosa genyu, na Dada venyu va Kilanga akuvahulumila na henye makosa genyu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Lechelelo Manyi muleche kuvahulumila vanu vanji makosa gawo, na Dada venyu va Kilanga siakuvahulumila na henye makosa genyu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dahitsa ndongwa tsa kufunga kulya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Yesu akendelelaje kudahitsa, “Homukuva mufuntsile kulya mulekaje kususutala kota fyovaditaga vanu vapunganitsi, Kwasawuli vene vasusutalaga kumiho ili vawoneche kwa vanu kuta vafuntsile kulya, lelo ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta vanu iwo mwanga vapasile chifunje chawo. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Lechelelo homukuva mufuntsile kulya, mwibakaje mafuta kumutwi na kwisilula kumiho, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ili vanu valeche kutsela kuta henye mufuntsile kulya, ila Dada venyu yo ali hono halufiho akuvapela chifunje.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hachiba ya Kilanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Lukasi 12:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Yesu akendelelaje kuvalonjela, “Mulekaje kuvika hachiba ya finu mu inyi, hono hanya migongoli myananjifu na kutu fifuluche fyananje, na kaha vahitsi vafuluche vabene na kuhitsa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Lechelelo mwivichile hachiba Kilanga kwa Mulungu ko kuduhu migongoli myananjifu na kutu sifikwananga, na vahitsi sivafuluche vabene na kuhitse. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kwasawuli hono hoyili hachiba yako ho baho numbula yako ho yikuva.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwangatsa gwa muvili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Lukasi 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Yesu akendelelaje kulonga, “Miho gako go lusolola lwa muvili gwako, lelo miho gako manyi gave mumi na muvili gwako gweka gukuva mu mwangatsa, <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />lechelelo manyi miho gako gave mabofu, muvili gwako gweka gukuva mu jitsa. Lelo manyi mwangatsa goguli mugati mwa heve guve jitsa, kota mwanga goguli mugati mwako gukuva mujitsa ukuva uli mujitsa ngomi.”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu na mali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Lukasi 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Kuduhuli munu yoyuve yo afuluche kuvatumichila vavina vavili, kwasawuli akumuvipila yumwe na kumugana yunji awu akihantsa na yumwe na kumubedala yunji. Henye nanye simufuluche kumutumichila Mulungu na mali. <verse eid="MAT 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Kwasawuli iyo ntsinguvalonjelani mulekaje kitindivasila kuta, tukulya chichi awu tukung'wa chichi na kaha mivili jenyu mukufwala chichi. Mbe, wumi wenyu sichiba kulutila chilyo, na mivili jenyu sichiba kulutila myenda? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Mulavaje fideje fyene sifilimaga na kubeta na kaha filihela kano, lechelelo Dada venyu va Kilanga afilisaga fideje ifyo. Mbe, henye simulichiba kulutila fideje ifyo? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Mbe, koyoli munu hagati henyu yo afuluche itindilivase na kuvetsa kiwila wumi wake wa kikala nambe lisala limwe? <verse eid="MAT 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Mbe, henye nanye kwasawuli yachi mungitindilivasila kwajili ya myenda? Mulole hila wuluva wa kivindi siwufuluche widitile myenda. Sinambe wukole kasi wala kibota. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjela kuta, nambe mwene muntsajila Solomoni mu wumelemo wake weka siafwalaga kota wuluva wa kivindi. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Duve, manyi Mulungu awufwikaga ihyo wuluva wa mwivindi, wo wufuluche wuve munyi guno na mitondo wun'nyanywa. Mbe, akulemwa kuvadita henye vagaya litumbilo muve kulutila wuluva uwo?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Ihyo henye mulekaje kitindivasila na kuhotsa kuta, tukulya chichi? Awu tukung'wa chichi? Awu tukufwala chichi? <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kwasawuli finu ifyo fyeka fivatindilivasaga vanu wo sinambe vamuhulikitse Mulungu, lechelelo henye mutselaje kuta Dada venyu va kilanga antsela kuta henye nanye mungufigana finu ifyo. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ihyo musakaje tandi ndongwa tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu na kudita hila fyo agana Mulungu na finu ifyo fyeka mukupelwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Hoihyo lelo mulekaje kuhotsa ndongwa tsa mitondo, kwasawuli ndongwa tsa mitondo tsikitindivasa tsene. Wutindilivasi wa munyiguno wuvaje wa munyiguno ng'ani.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kuleka kuvahiga vanu vanji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Lukasi 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">Lukasi 6:41-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Mulekaje kuvahiga vanu vanji, ili na henye muleche kuhigwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Kwasawuli manyi uvahije vanu vanji na heve ukuhigwa hihila. Kota hila fyo uvaditye vanu vanji na Mulungu akukuditila hihyo. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Kwasawuli yachi unlola kabadu ka lubawo kokali muliho lya mung'olotso, na heve sinambe wilole libadu lya muliho lyako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Unvetsa chinya ndawuli kumulonjela mung'olotso kuta mung'olotsangu, hondi nguhetse kabadu kokali mugati mu liho lyako, na kuno heve una libadu muliho lyako? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Heve uli mupunganitsi, uhetse tandi libadu lyoyili mu liho lyako, ihyo ho ukukawona finofu kabadu kokali mu liho lya mung'olotso.”<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Mulekaje kujipela mibwa finu fihagulwa na Mulungu kwasawuli jifuluche kuvalumanga, na kaha mulekaje kujitotsela migubi finu fyenyu fya galama, kwasawuli manyi mudite ihyo, jifuluche jikanyaganje.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusuka, na kusaka, na kuhodetsa.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Lukasi 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Musukaje, na henye mukupelwa. Musakaje, na henye mukupata. Muhodetsaje na henye mukudindulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kwasawuli chila yo nsuka akupelwa, na yo ansaka akupata, na yo akuhodetsa akudindulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Mbe, kwenyu kuna munu vachi manyi mwanage amusuche libumunda, mwene akumupela liganga? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Awu manyi amusuche somba, mwene akumupela ntsoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Henye vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi mun'daha kuvapela vana venyu finu finofu, mbe ndawuli kwa Dada venyu va Kilanga akuleka kuvapela finu finofu vala wo vangumusuka? <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Ho hihyo chila chinu cho mun'gana muditilwe na vanu, na henye nanye mun'ganika muvaditile hihyo. Kwasawuli igo go malajitso ga Musa na valoli va Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwitsi lunyehe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Lukasi 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Mwinjilaje kwa kukolela mulwitsi lunyehe, kwasawuli ng'asi ngatsi na lwitsi lugatsi fim'bitila ku wananjifu, wo vankwinjila mu lwitsi ulo na ng'asi iyo vakuva wolofu. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Lechelelo lwitsi lo lunyehe na ng'asi nyehe fim'bitila kono ko kuna wumi, nawo wo vanguyitsela ng'asi ya wumi uwo wo vanu vadodo hela.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubichi na mibawo jake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43">Lukasi 6:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Mwiyangalilaje na valoli va wudesi, vanu wo vanguvatsila kuno vafwite myenda kota ng'olo, lechelelo kwa mugati vana kota ngwami ng'ali. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Mukuvatsela kwa ndongwa tsawo tso van'dita. Mbe, vanu vabavaga mibawo ja mitsabibu mu mibichi jinya mifwa, awu vabavaga matongatonga mu mibichi jojinchemwa michongoma? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Ho hihyo mubichi munofu gulelaga mibawo minofu, na kaha mubichi mubi gulelaga mibawo mibi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mubichi munofu sigufuluche gulele mibawo mibi, na kaha mubichi mubi sigulelaga mibawo minofu ndaya. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Lechelelo chila mubichi go sinambe gulele mibawo minofu gukutemwa na kudibulwa mumoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Ihyo vanu iwo mukuvatsela kwa ndongwa tsawo tso van'dita.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukanwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Lukasi 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Siyo chila munu yo anyema Mutwa, Mutwa, yo akwinjila mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. Lechelelo munu yula yo akudita ndongwa tso an'gana Dada vangu yo ali Kilanga.”<verse eid="MAT 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Siku iyo ya wuhigo vanu wolofu vakundonjela, “Mutwa, Mutwa! Hetwe twavikulaga ndongwa tsako, na kujihetsa misoka na kaha twaditaga ndajilo myolofu kwa litawa lyako. <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Ihyo nguvalonjela kuta, sintsivatsele, muwuche kwa heni, henye yo mun'dita ndongwa ntsibi!”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatsentsi vavili va nyumba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Lukasi 6:47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Ihyo munu yoyuve yo anhulika na kudita ndongwa tsangu, anakota munu munya nyala yo atsentsile nyumba yake mwilanga mwa litalawe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ndonya manyi yitonye na litse likuka, na yitse ng'ala ngomi fiyitove nyumba iyo siyikugwa, kwasawuli musinji gwake gunkuva gutsentsilwe mu litalawe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Lechelelo munu yoyuve yo anhulika madahitso gangu na kuleka kugadita, anakota munu mupuva yo atsentsile nyumba yake mu luganga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ndonya yikatonyaje na likuka likatsaje, na ng'ala ngomi yikawugaje na kuyikunugitsa nyumba yila, nayo yikagwaje, na wugwaji wake wukavaje wukomi.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuvetso wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ihyo Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso, vanu vakatinukaje hila fyo adahitsaga, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Kwasawuli siadahitsaga kota vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, lechelelo adahitsaga kota munu munya wuvetso.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa mutamwa va wububa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lukasi 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu hoavaga ankwika kuhuma ku chidunda, lilugu likomi lya vanu likamufwataje. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Munu yumwe munya wutamwa wa wububa akamutsilaje Yesu, akafugamaje halutalo ha Yesu na kulonga, “Mutwa manyi ugane ufuluche umonetse ili tsindichilwe mu ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu!” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu akagololaje liwoko lyake, akamubataje na kumulonjela, “Ntsin'gana upone ili widichilwe mu ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu!” Baho baho yula mutamwa munya wububa akaponaje. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Kaha Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Walahogola kumulonjela munu yoyuve lulongwa luno, lechelelo ubite ukilajile kwa vatawula nambiko vakuwone kuta uponile na ukatawule sadaka kota fyo alajitse Musa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa mutantsi va muvina va Chiloma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Lukasi 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Siku yimwe Yesu ho avaga ankwinjila mu muji gwa Kapelinawumu, muvina yumwe va vimilitsi akatsaje, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />na kumugongola kuta, “Mutwa, mutantsi vangu avasise kukaye, antamika wutamwa wa kupola muvili gweka, na kaha avaga atache ndalahela.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ngutsa kumuponetsa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Lechelelo yula muvina va vimilitsi akamulonjelaje kuta, “Mutwa, heni sinambe fwaye heve winjile mu nyumba yangu, lechelelo ulonje lulongwa hela na mutantsi vangu akupona. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kwasawuli heni ntsili mu wutavala, na kaha heni ntsi muvina va vatova ligalu, manyi ntsimulonjele yumwe, bite kula, nayo am'bita, na kaha manyi ntsimulonjele mutantsi vangu kuta, utse, atsaga, na manyi ntsimulonjele kuta, dite hino, nayo aditaga.” <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, akapomokaje na kuvalonjela vala wo vamufwataga, Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, “Ntsing'ali kumuwona munu munya litumbilo likomi kota lino kwa vanu va mu inyi ya Isilaheli.” <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Ntsinguvalonjela kuta, “Vanu wolofu vakutsa kuhuma lubali lwa kulihumilo lwa litsuva na kulisotelo lwa litsuva, nawo vakikala hamwe na Ibulahimu, na Yisaka, na Yakobo muliwungo lya kulya na kung'wa ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />lechelelo vana va Wuntsajila, vakutotswa mu lijitsa la kivala, ko kukuva na chivembo na kugwegwetsula mino.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Kaha Yesu akamulonjelaje yula muvina, “Ubite na yivaje ihyo kota fyo witumbye. Mutantsi va yula muvina akaponaje luvala lulo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu wolofu mu nyumba ya Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lukasi 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu hoavaga kufika ha nyumba ya Petulo, akamufikaje yuve va mudala va Petulo antamika mbungo na avasise mulusaga. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Akamubataje liwoko lyake nayo akaponaje namwa yake, akinukaje na kwantsa kumuwuyapila Yesu chilyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Hokwavaga kuva hamihe, vanu vakamuletelaje Yesu vanu wolofu vanya misoka na namwa, nayo akajihetsaje misoka na kuvaponetsa vatamwa veka. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ndongwa itsi tsihumye ili lukwile lulongwa lo ali alontsile Isaya muloli va Mulungu kuta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Mwene atuhetsye ng'odeko tsetu, hamwe na namwa tsetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hila fyo van'ganika kuva vanu wo vangumufwata Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Lukasi 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu hoavaga kuwona vanu wolofu vamupilime, akavalajitsaje vadahitswa vake valowoche kumwambu gwa lilamba lya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Mudahitsi yumwe va malajitso ga Musa akabitaje kwa Yesu na kumulonjela, “Mudahitsi, kokuve ko um'bita heni ngukufwata,”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Micheve jina malika, na fideje fina fifulya, lechelelo heni Mwana va Munu, ntsihela hono ha wuvaso.” <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Mudahitswa vake yumwe akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mutwa, mele luhusa mbite ngamutsiche dada vangu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Lechelelo Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ufwate heni! Valeche vanu wo vanakota vafweye vavatsiche vanu vawo wo vafweye.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyikatukitsa mavimbi makomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lukasi 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Kaha Yesu akakwinaje mu mutumbwi hamwe na vadahitswa vake. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Simusika, kukahumilaje ng'ala ngomi na mavimbi gakantsaje kugukunujitsa mutumbwi, na mutumbwi gula gukantsaje kugubikitswa na malenga, lechelelo Yesu avaga avasise tulo. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Vadahitswa vake vakabitaje kumulamusa na kumulonjela kuta, “Mutwa, utukuluse, tunkufwa!” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Henye vanya litumbilo lidodo munkogopa chinu chachi?” Akinukaje na akayikatukitsaje yila ng'ala na bahali, kukasichimalaje. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Vadahitswa va Yesu vakavaje na muloto ndalahela na vakiputsaje, “Mbe, yuno munu vachi mbaka ng'ala ngomi na mavimbi fingumuhulikitsa?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu vavili vanya misoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lukasi 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu ho avaga kulowoka kumwambu gwa lilamba lya Galilaya, akafikaje ku inyi ya Vajelasi, akitang'anaje na valume vavili vanya misoka wo vavaga vangikala ku makabuli. Vanu iva vavaga vakali ndala hela, sikwavaga na munu yo avetsaga kulutila mu ng'asi iyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Nawo vayovaga na kulonga, “Tuna chichi na heve Mwana va Mulungu? Mbe, utsitse kutukoda gung'acha kufika chipindi cha wuhigo?” <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Habehi na hono iho, kwavaga na chipinga cha migubi jo jadimwaga. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Duve misoka jila jikamugongoletsaje Yesu kwa kulonga, “Manyi utuhetse kwa vanu iva, utuleche twinjile mu chipinga chila cha migubi.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu akajilonjelaje jila misoka, “Ale mubite!” Ihyo misoka jikavahumaje vanu vala na kujinjila migubi jila, chipinga cheka cha migubi chikikaje mu lweta luvilo na kwinjila mu lilamba, jikafwaje. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Vanu wo vajidimaga migubi jila vakabilimaje, na kubita ku muji na kuvalonjela vanu ndongwa tso tsihumye kwa vala valume vavili vanya misoka. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Kaha vanu veka va muji gula vakabitaje kitang'ana na Yesu. Nawo hovavaga kumuwona Yesu, vakamugongolaje awuche ku muji gwawo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu yo apotsile muvili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lukasi 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu akakwinaje mu mutumbwi na kulowoka lilamba akafikaje ku muji gwawo. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Kahi vanu vanji vakamuletelaje munu yo apotsile muvili yoavaga avasise mu mulusaga, Yesu hoavaga kuliwona litumbilo lyawo, akamulonjelaje munu yula yo apotsile, “Mwanangu, wikangatse numbula yako! Uhulumilwe ndongwa tsako ntsibi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Vadahitsi vamwe va malajitso ga Musa vakahulikaje cho alontsile Yesu, vakalonganaje kuta, “Munu yuno angumuliga Mulungu!” <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu hoavaga kutsela chovanhotsa akalongaje, “Kwasawuli yachi munhotsa fibi mu numbula tsenyu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Chinu chachi cho chipefu, kulonga kuta, uhulumilwe ndongwa tsako ntsibi? Awu kulonga kuta winuche ubite? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Lechelelo ili mutsele kuta Mwana va Munu anawo wuvetso wa kuvahulumila vanu ndongwa tsawo ntsibi.” Kaha Yesu akamulonjelaje munu yula yo apotsile, “Winuche utegule lusaga lwako na ubite kukaye kwako.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Munu yula yo apotsile, akinukaje na kubita kukaye kwake. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Vanu veka wo vavaga vakong'ine vavaga kutsiwona ndongwa itso, vakavaje na muloto, kahi vakamutsumitsaje Mulungu kwa kuvapela vanu wuvetso uwo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuchema Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lukasi 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu hoavaga anlutila kuhuma uko akamuwonaje munu yumwe yo anchemwa Matayo, yo avaga ichite hono ha kukongotsa kodi, Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ufwate heni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Nayo Matayo akinukaje akamufwataje Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu hoavaga ichite mu nyumba ya Matayo alye chilyo hamwe na vadahitswa vake, vakatsaje vakongotsa kodi hamwe na vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi vakikalaje na kulya na Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Vafwalisayo hovavaga kuwona ihyo, vakavawutsaje vadahitswa vake kuta, “Mbona mudahitsi venyu ankulya hamwe na vakongotsa kodi na vanu vanya ndongwa tsibi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu hoavaga kuhulika ihyo akavalonjelaje, “Vanu wosinambe vatamiche sivamusakaga muganga, lechelelo vatamwa wo vamusakaga muganga. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Lecheleo mubite mukidahitse mana ya ndongwa tsino, ntsin'gana lusungu, ndema nambiko, kwasawuli singatsitse kuvachema vanu vawuya, ila ngatsitse kwasawuli ya vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga kufunga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lukasi 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Kaha vadahitswa va Yohana mubatitsi vakatsaje kwa Yesu na kumuputsa, “Mbe, kwasawuli ya chichi hetwe na Vafwalisayo tunfunga na vadahitswa vako sinambe vafunje kumusuka Mulungu?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Mbe, munu hoakuva antola mudala, vanu yo valibulitswe mulitsenjele vafuluche vave na ng'ung'uto na kuleka kulya na kung'wa! Ndaya. Lechelelo chikufika chipindi munya kukwela hoakuva awusile hagati hawo, iho ho vakuganika kufunga kulya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Kuduhu munu yo afuluche ahoneletse chilaka chipya mu mwenda mulovela. Lechelelo manyi adite ihyo, chila chilaka chipya chikumamuka kuhuma mu mwenda gula mulovela, na hala ho hatubwiche hakuva hakomi. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Kaha kuduhu munu yo avikaga difwayi ntsipya mu mifuko misakafu jo jiwuyipwe kwa nyingo ya ng'olo. Manyi adite ihyo mifuko jila misakafu jikutwadika na difwayi yila yikubohoka. Ihyo difwayi ntsipya yivikwaga mu mifuko mipya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhintsa va Yayilo na mudala amponetswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lukasi 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu hoavaga anlonga ndongwa itso, akatsaje muvina yumwe va Chiyawudi, akamufugamilaje na kulonga, “Muhintsa vangu afweye sambi, lelo ntsinsuka utse umuvichile mawoko nayo akuva mumi”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Ihyo Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakabitasaje na munu yula. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Hovavaga vam'bita mudala yumwe yo avaga na wutamwa wa kuhuma danda miyaka kumi na jivili, akamufwataje Yesu kwa kumbele na akibataje lupembo lwa mwenda gwa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Adisile ihyo kwasawuli ilonje mu numbula yake kuta, “Manyi ndometse hela lupembo lwa mwenda gwake, ngupona.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Ihyo Yesu akapitukaje, nayo hoavaga kumuwona mudala yula akamulonjelaje, “Muhintsa vangu, wikangatsaje! Litumbilo lyako likuponitse.” Duve mudala yula akaponaje kuhuma luvalalulo.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Kaha Yesu akinjilaje mu nyumba ya yula chilongotsi, akavawonaje vanu vampemba fwilimbi na lilugu lya vanu vanlomboketsa, na kuvemba ndalahela, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muwuche hono hano kwasawuli muhintsa yuno si afweye ndaya, ila avasise hela.” Lechelelo vanu iwo vakamuhekaje ndalahela kwa mbedatsi.<verse eid="MAT 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Lechelelo vanu hovavaga kuhumitswa kivala, Yesu akinjilaje mu nyumba akamubataje liwoko muhintsa yula, nayo akalamukaje.<verse eid="MAT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Ndongwa itso tsikatagalilaje mu inyi yila yeka.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu vavili wo vabofwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu hoavaga an'wuka hono hala, vanu vavili wo vabofwe vakamufwataje kuno vankola kuva, “Mwana va Dawudi utuhulumile.”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Hala Yesu hoavaga kwinjila mu nyumba, fibofu vala vakatsaje kwake, Yesu akavaputsaje, “Mbe, muna litumbilo kuta heni ntsinvetsa kuvaponetsa?” Nawo vakalongaje, “Ena, Mutwa tungitumba.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Ihyo Yesu akavabataje miho gawo na kuvalonjela, “Yive hihyo kota fyo mungitumba.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Bahobaho miho gawo gakantsaje kulola. Yesu akavalemetsaje kwa kuhahanitsa kuta, “Muleche kumulonjela munu yoyuve lulongwa luno.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Lechelelo vene vakawukaje na kwantsa kutagalitsa ndongwa tsa Yesu mu inyi yila yeka.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa chibubwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Vanu hovavaga van'wuka kubita kwawo, vanu vanji vakamusindichilaje Yesu munu yo avaga chibubwi kwasawuli avaga na lisoka. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Bahobaho Yesu ho avaga kulihetsa lisoka lila, munu yula akavetsaje kulonga. Vanu vakapomokaje na kulonga, “Lulongwa kota luno silwali luhumye hohave mu inyi ya Isilaheli!” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Lechelelo Vafwalisayo vakalongaje, “Angujivinga misoka kwa wuvetso wa muvina va misoka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvawonela lusungu vanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Nayo Yesu akajijendelaje miji jeka na fijiji fyeka kuno an'dahitsa, na kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayahudi na kuponetsa namwa tseka.<verse eid="MAT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Yesu hoavaga kugawona malugu kwa malugu ga vanu akawawonelaje lusungu, kwasawuli vavaga vankodeka kota ng'olo tsotsilihela mudimi.<verse eid="MAT 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Ihyo akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake kuta, “Finu fya kubeta fyolofu, lechelelo vabetaji vadodo. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Lelo mumusuche Mutwa va fibetwa ili avasindiche vanu ku mugunda gwake gwa fibetwa vakabete.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Vatumi kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lukasi 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu akavachemaje vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili, akavapelaje mamulaka ga kujivinga misoka na kuponetsa namwa tsa chila ayina. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Matawa ga vadahitswa vake wo avachemile vatumi go iga, mulongola yo Simoni yo achemwaga Petulo, na mung'olotse yo achemwaga Andeleya, na Yakobo mwana va Tsebedayo, na mung'olotse yo achemwaga Yohana, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Fwilipo, na Batulomayo, na Tomasi, na Matayo yo avaga mukongotsa kodi, na Yakobo mwana va Alufwayo, na Tadeyi, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni yo ayitovanilaga inyi yake, na Yuda Isikaliyote yoamugalwiche Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvatuma vatumi kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lukasi 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu akavatumaje iwo vatumi kumi na vavili na kuvalajitsa hino, “Mulekaje kubita kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi, na kaha mulekaje kwinjila mu miji ja Vasamaliya. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Lechelelo mubite kwa vanu va Isilaheli yo vanakota ng'olo tsotsiyatsile. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Homukuva muhele muvavikulilaje vanu kuta, Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wulihabehi. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Muvaponetsaje vatamwa, na muvatsilipulaje vanu, na muvaponetsaje vanu vanya wububa, na muhetsaje misoka, kwasawuli mupasile bule, na henye mutawulaje bule. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mulekaje kutegula tsahabu, awu madini ga fetsa, awu magobole ga saba mu mifuko jenyu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Awu libeji lya myenda, awu myenda ja kubadila, awu filatu fya kubadila, awu ng'weku, kwasawuli munu yo ankola katsi an'ganika kuhombwa.”<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Muji goguve awu chijiji chochive cho mukwinjila, mumusache munu yo akuvalibulitsa, manyi avalibulitse mwinjile mwikale kwake mbaka homukuwuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Homukuva mwinje mu nyumba iyo, muvasamuse kwa kuvalonjela kuta, Mulungu avapele wusichimafu. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Manyi vanyakaye va nyumba iyo vavalibutse finofu, wusichimafu wenyu wuvaje nawo, lechelelo manyi si ihyo wusichimafu wuvapiluchilaje henye. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Manyi munu aleche kuvalibulitsa na kuvahulikitsa ndongwa tsenyu, homukuva munhuma mu nyumba yila awu muji gula mukung'unaje mingundi ja mu magulu genyu, kuvalajila kuta hetwe tulimuduhu kwa chochive chochikuvapata, ili viwukaje.” <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, siku ya wuhigo vanu vanya isho Mulungu akuvahiga ndalahela kulutila vanu wovikalaga ku inyi tsa Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'odeko tso tsinkutsa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Lukasi 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Mwiyangalilaje! Ntsinguvatuma kota ng'olo hagati ha ngwami. Lelo muvaje na nyala kota ntsoka, na kahi muvaje vadeche kota ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mwiyangalilaje, kwasawuli vanu vamwe vakuva tebe na henye, vakuvabata na vakuvasindika mu nyumba tsa wuhigo na kuvatova mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Nanye mukubulunwa mbaka halutalo ha libalatsa na vantsajila kwasawuli ya heni, ili muvalonjele Ndongwa Nofu na kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Lechelelo hovakuvasindika kuko, mulekaje kuhotsa cho mukulonga, kwasawuli luvalalulo mukupelwa cho mukuganika kulonga. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kwasawuli siyo henye yomukuva munlonga, lechelelo Muhe va Mulungu yo Dada venyu akuvatanga cha kulonga”<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Munu akumugaluka mung'olotse ili akopolwe, na dada akumugaluka mwanage, nawo vana vakuva tebe na valeli vawo na kuvambutsa vakopolwe.” <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Henye mukuvipilwa na vanu veka kwasawuli ya heni, lechelelo yo akikangatsa mbaka ha wudugo, uyo yo akukuluswa na Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Lechelelo hala ho vakuvakoda ku muji gumwe, henye mubilimilaje ku muji gunji. Kwakuva ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, mbaka ho akutsa Mwana va Munu simukusinda miji jeka ja Isilaheli.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Mudahitswa si amulutilaga mudahitsi vake, na mupogotsi siamulutilaga muvina vake.<verse eid="MAT 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Yikwilaje kuta mudahitswa ave kota mudahitsi vake, na mupogotsi kuva kota muvina vake. Manyi muvina va kaye vamuchemile Belitsebuli, mbe! Vala wovali mukaye iyo sivakuchemwa matawa mabi ndalahela?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoan'ganika kogopwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Lukasi 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Ihyo mulekaje kuwogopa vanu wovanfiha finu fyo van'dita, lechelelo kuna chipindi chinkutsa chila munu akutsela chovaditaga.”<verse eid="MAT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Lulongwa lo tsavalonje ho tuliyena, mukavalonjele vanu na lula lotsivalonjeni kwa kupwepa muluvikule kwa vanu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mulekaje kuwogopa vanu wovavetsa kuvakopola henye, lechelelo vanlemwa kuvakopola myuhe jenyu. Lechelelo chiba umwogope munu yula yo afuluche avakopole henye na myuhe jenyu mu moto go sigutsimikaga.<verse eid="MAT 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Mbe, fitolohondo fivili si figutswaga kwa sendi yimwe? Lechelelo nambe chimwe sichigwaga hasi bila Dada venyu kutsela. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Lechelelo henye Mulungu avalye nambe fwili tsa mitwi jenyu tseka atsivalye.<verse eid="MAT 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ihyo mulekaje kuva na muloto, kwasawuli Mulungu anguvalola ndalahela henye kulutila fitolohondo ifyo.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumudichila na kumukana Chilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8">Lukasi 12:8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Chila munu yoakindichila heni halutalo ha vanu kuta mwene yo munu vangu, na heni ngumudichila halutalo ha Dada vangu va Kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Lechelelo munu yoyuve yo akung'ana halutalo ha vanu kuta mwene siyo vangu, na heni ngumukana halutalo ha Dada vangu va kilanga.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sindetite wusichimafu ila waladi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Lukasi 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Mulekaje kuhotsa kuta ntsitsitse kuleta wusichimafu mu inyi, heni sintsitsitse kuleta wusichimafu ila ndetite wutelani.<verse eid="MAT 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kwasawuli ntsitsitse kuleta wutelani hagati ha munu na dade, na muhintsa na yuve, na kaha mukwi na mukwive, <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />na vatelani va munu wovala wovali mukaye yake. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Munu yoyuve yo angumugana yuve awu dade kulutila kungana heni, siafuluche ave mudahitswa vangu. Munu yoyuve yoangumugana mwana vake mukwamitsi awu muhintsa kulutila heni, siafuluche ave mudahitswa vangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Munu yoyuve yo siakuva chang'ani kukodeka mbaka kufwa kwa kufwata heni, siafuluche ave mudahitswa vangu.<verse eid="MAT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Munu yoyuve yo akuhagula kuwukulusa wumi wake uyo akuwuyatsa, na yo akuhagula kuwuyatsa wumi wake kwasawuli ya heni akuwukulusa.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chifunje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliko 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />Munu yo yuve yo akuvalibulitsa henye akuva andibulitse heni, na yo yuve yo akundibulitsa heni akuva amulibulitse yula yo anumile. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Munu yoakumwanuchila muloli va Mulungu kwasawuli ali muloli va Mulungu, uyo akupata chifunje cha muloli va Mulungu, nayo yo akumwanuchila yula yo an'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, uyo akupata chifunje cha munu yo an'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, munu yoyuve yo akumupela yumwe va vadodo iva nambe chikombe cha malenga matsitsimu kwasawuli ali mudahitswa vangu, Mulungu akumupela nachene chifunje chake.<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Yohana mubatitsi antuma vajumbe kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Lukasi 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kuvapela malajitso vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili, akawukaje hono hala akabitaje kudahitsa na kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu ku miji ja Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Nayo Yohana hoavaga mu nyumba ya wuwopwa, akahulikaje ndongwa tso avaga an'dita Yesu, ihyo akavatumaje vadahitswa vake vakamuputse Yesu kuta, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />“Mbe, heve yo yula Chilisito yo ankutsa awu tumutsindile yunji?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mubite mukamulonjele Yohana ndongwa tso munhulika na kutsiwona. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Vanu wo vabofwe vanlola, na fiteve van'jnda, na vanya wububa vamponetswa na kidichilwa mu ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu, na vadibafu vanhulika, na wovafweye van'tsilipulwa, na vagayu vanvikulilwa Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Atambichilwe na Mulungu vanu vala yo sinambe vave na muhwehwe na heni.<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Vala vadahitswa va Yohana mubatitsi hovavaga kuwuka, Yesu akavaputsaje vanu ndongwa tsa Yohana mubatitsi, “Mbe, mukali muhele kukola chichi ku mbuga? Mukali muhele kulava lisoli lyo lintigatswa na ng'ala?” <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Manyi si ihyo mukali muhele kulola chichi? Mukali muhele kulola munu yo afwite myenda ja galama? Ndaya, wovafwalaga myenda ja galama vali mu nyumba tsa vantsajila. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Lelo mundonjele, muka muhele kulola chichi? Kumulola muloli? Ndaya! Munu yo alutye kwa muloli. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Uyo yo akalontswile mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, “Mulave, heni ntsingumutuma mutantsi vangu yo akukulongola, uyo yo akuvika chang'ani ng'asi ya kukola heve.” <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />“Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, Yohana mubatitsaji yo muvina kulutila vanu veka va chilelo cha mudala, nambe ihyo munu yo akuva mudodo ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, uyo yo muvina kulutila Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Luhuma chipindi cha Yohana mubatitsi mbaka sambi, Wuntsajila wa Mulungu vanu vabi vanya wuvetso van'jla kuwusukula ili wuve wawo. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Madahitso geka ga valoli veka va Mulungu na malajitso ga Musa, galontsile chila chochikuhumila mbaka chipindi cha Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Manyi mulichang'ani kidichila, mwidichile kuta Yohana yo Eliya yovalontsile kuta yoakakutsa. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Munu munya mapilichilo gakuhulichila na ahuliche! <verse eid="MAT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Tuvahwanitse na chinu chachi Vanu va siku tsino? Chihwanite na vana yo vichite mu luga lwa kugutsila finu, kuno vanguvalonjela vayawo vanji kutijila, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />tuvatovye ndutsi, lechelelo heny simukawuntsile. Kahi tuvimbye ntsimbo ya kulomboketsa lechelelo simukalombokitse! <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kwasawuli Yohana ho atsitse, avaga sinambe alye na kung'wa difwayi, valontsile kuta anajo misoka. <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana va Munu atsitse, avaga ankulya na kung'wa, vanlonga kuta mulave! Munu uyu muhatufu na mugatsi!” Kaha angiyenda na vakongotsa kodi hamwe na vanu yovan'dita ndongwa ntsibi! Ihyo ntselo ya Mulungu yinlajilwa kuta ya wukweli, kukolela kwa ndongwa tsake tso tsin'ditwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu va miji wosinambe vamutumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Lukasi 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Hambele Yesu akantsaje kuvakotola vanu va miji jo ajiditye ndajilo myolofu na vanu vake valemile kumutumba Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Mukudutsa henye vanu wo mungikala ku Kolatsini! Mukudutsa henye vanu va ku Betisaida, kwasawuli manyi ndajilo jongadisile kwenyu ntsikantsive ntsivaditye vanu va ku miji ja Tilo na Sidoni, vanu vake vaka kusuka kuhulumilwa kwa kufwala magunila na kibakatsa michifu kulajila kuta vangumupituchila Mulungu na vanleka ndongwa tsawo ntsibi.” <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, siku ya wuhigo henye mukuhigwa kulutila vanu va miji ja Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Henye vanu va ku Kalipenawumu! Mbe, mukudutswa mbaka Kilanga? Manyi mudite ihyo, mukwiswa mbaka ku inyi ya vanu wo vafweye. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjela kuta, siku ya wuhigo henye mukuhigwa kulutila vanu va muji gwa Sodoma.<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutse kwa heni mwesele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21">Lukasi 10:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Chipindi icho Yesu akalongaje, “Ntsingukulumba Dada, Mutwa va Kilanga na inyi, kwasawuli ndongwa itsi uvafihile vanu vanya ntselo na uvagubulye vanu wovanakota vana vadodo. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Enaa! Kwasawuli yiveye kota fyo waganile yive. <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Dada vangu amelye finu fyeka. Kuduhu munu yoyuve yo amutsele Mwana ila Dada, kaha kuduhu munu yoyuve yo amutsele Dada ila Mwana, na munu yoyuve mwana yo angumugana kumugubulila.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Mutse kwa heni henye nyeka yo munkodeka na kukobadiswa na mbomolo sito, na heni nguvadita mwesele. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mundichile na kunumichila heni na mwidahitse kwa heni, kwasawuli heni ntsimudeche na tsilihela chidada na henye mukupata weselo mu numbula tsenyu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kwasawuli madahitso go ntsinguvadahitsa siyo matalamu, na kaha madahitso gangu mupefu hela.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsa siku ya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lukasi 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Chipindi icho Yesu alutilaga mu migunda ja ngano Siku ya Kwesela. Vadahitswa vake vavaga na ntsala, vakantsaje kubena maho ga wuhemba na kwantsa kulya ndete. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Vafwalisayo hovavaga kuwona ihyo, vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Lave vadahitswa vako van'dita ndongwa tsotsin'ganika tsiditwe ha Siku ya Kwesela.” <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mbe, simwasomile cho adisile muntsajila Daudi hamwe na vayage hala hovavaga na ntsala?” <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Mwene inje mu Nyumba ya Mulungu na kulya hamwe na vayage mabumunda gogavisilwe kwasawuli ya Mulungu, go sigaganikaga galiwe na munu yoyuve ila na vatawula nambiko ng'ani? <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Mbe, kaha simwasomile mu fitabu fya malajitso ga Musa kuta, chila Siku ya Kwesela vatawula nambiko vayanangaga Siku ya Kwesela mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, lechelelo sinambe vahotselwe kuta vana nongwa yoyive? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjelani kuta, hono iha hoyoli muvina kulutila Nyumba ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Manyi muka muntsele mana ya ndongwa itsi kuta, ntsin'gana lusungu, na sinambengane nambiko, simuka kuvahiga vanu wo valihela nongwa yoyive. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Kwasawuli Mwana va Munu yo Mutwa va Siku ya Kwesela.<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu yo apotsile liwoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lukasi 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu akawukaje hono iho, akabitaje mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Mumo mwavaga na munu yumwe yo apotsile liwoko, nawo Vafwalisayo vanji vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Mbe, yiganikaga kumuponetsa munu Siku ya Kwesela?” Vamuputsitse ihyo ili vapate chambutso cha kumuhiga. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mbe, kuna munu yumwe hagati henyu munya ng'olo yo yinje mu likombo ha Siku ya Kwesela, yoafuluche ayileche kuyibata na kuyihumya kivala Siku ya Kwesela?” <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjelani kuta, munu yo va mana kulutila ng'olo, ihyo tun'ganika kudita ndongwa nofu Siku ya Kwesela <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ihyo Yesu akamulonjelaje munu yula kuta,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">“Golole liwoko lyako.” Nayo akagololaje, nalyo likavaje lyumi nachene kota liyake. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ihyo Vafwalisayo vakahumaje kivala, na kwantsa kulongana hila fyo vakumukopola Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutantsi yo ahagulwe na Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yesu hoaveye kuhulika kuta Vafwalisayo van'gana kumukopola akawukaje hono iho, vanu wolofu vakamufwataje, nayo akavaponetsaje vatamwa veka, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />na akavalemetsaje valeche kuvalonjela vanu vanji ndongwa tsake. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Yesu avalemitse ili lukwile lulongwa lo alontsile Isaya muloli va Mulungu kuta,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Mulave mutantsi vangu yo ntsimuhagwe, na yontsimuganile, na yo anganitsa numbula yangu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Ihyo nguvika Muhe gwangu kwake, nayo akuvikula ndongwa tsa wuhigo wa heni kwa vanu veka.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Siakupungana awu kuyova, na kaha litsi lyake silikuhulikwa mung'asi.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Siakulubena ludenje lolubibinde, na kaha si akuyitsimya koloboyi yo yilihabehi na kutsima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Mbaka ho akudita wuwuya wusume. <verse eid="MAT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Vanu va inyi tseka vakuva na lihuvilo kwa mwene.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belitsebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lukasi 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Kahi vanu vakamuletelaje Yesu munu chibubwi na kaha avaga chibofu kwasawuli avaga na misoka. Yesu akamuponetsaje munu yula akavetsaje kulonga na kulola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Vanu veka vakapomokaje na kiputsa kuta, “Mbe, uyu afuluche ave Mwana va wilaho va Dawudi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Lechelelo Mafwalisayo hovavaga kuhulika ihyo vakalongaje, “Munu uyu anvinga misoka kwa wuvetso woampelwa na muvina va misoka yo anchemwa Belitsebuli.” <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu akagatselaje mahotso gawo na kuvalonjela kuta, “Manyi wuntsajila wowuve wusumwane na kigava fipingafipinga, na kwitova siwufuluche wime, na nyumba yoyive awu vanu wovave wo vansumwine na kigava fipingafipinga sivafuluche vadite lulongwa loluve. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Manyi Lihoka lingulivinga lihoka liyage, likuva ligavise lyene mu fipingafipinga. Mbe, wuntsajila wake wukwima chinya ndawuli? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Henye munlonga ntsimvinga misoka kwa wuvetso wa Belitsebuli. Lelo manyi heni ntsive tsin'dita ihyo, na vanu yovanguvafwata henye, vakuva vangujivinga misoka kwa wuvetso wa nani? Kwasawuli iyo vene yo vakuvahiga henye. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Lechelelo manyi heni ntsimvinga misoka kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu, ihyo mutselaje kuta Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wufisile kwenyu.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Kuduhu munu yo afuluche injile mu nyumba ya munu munya ludali na kusukula finu fyake bila kumuwopa tandi. An'ganika amuwope tandi, na iho ho akuvetsa kumusukula finu fyake.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Munu yoyuve yo sinambe andichile alitebe na heni, na munu yoyuve yo sinambe akong'ase hamwe na heni uyo antagalitsa. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Lelo ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, Mulungu afuluche amuhulumile munu ndongwa ntsibi tsotsive tso akudita, lechelelo munu yo akumuliga Muhe va Mulungu, uyo siafuluche ahulumilwe.” <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Munu yoyuve yo akulonga lulongwa lubi loluve kwa Mwana va Munu akuhulumilwa, lechelelo munu yo akulonga lulongwa lwa kumuliga Muhe va Mulungu siakuhulumilwa sambi na siku tseka tsotsigaya wudugo.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubichi na mibawo jake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Lukasi 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Mubichi munofu gulelaga mibawo minofu, na mubichi mubi gulelaga mibawo mibi. Chila mubichi gutselanikaga kwa mibawo jake. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Henye yo mulivabi kota ntsoka tso tsina sumu, chinya ndawuli mufuluche mulonje ndongwa nofu na kuno henye mun'dita ndongwa ntsibi? Kwasawuli munu alongaga chila chochinhuma mu numbula yake. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Munu munofu ahumyaga ndongwa nofu kuhuma mu numbula yake, na munu mubi ahumyaga ndongwa ntsibi kuhuma mu numbula yake. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Duve ntsinguvalonjelani, chila lulongwa lubi lovanlonga vanu, lukuvalilwa mu siku yila ya wuhigo <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kwasawuli kwa ndonga yako ukuvalilwa kuta muwuya, na kaha kwa ndonga yako ukulajilwa kuta uli mubi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndajilo ya Yona</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Lukasi 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Siku yimwe kaha vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa hamwe na Vafwalisayo vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi tun'gana utulajile ndajilo.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Nayo Yesu akavajibulaje, “Chilelo cha waafu mun'gana ndajilo, simukupelwa ndajilo yoyive ila ndajilo ya Yona muloli va Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Kota hila Yoha fyo ichite siku tsidatu mu lileme lya lisomba likomi, ho hihyo nayo Mwana va Munu fyo akikala hanyi siku tsidatu hamunyi na hachilo. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Siku yila ya wuhigo vanu va muji gwa Ninavi vakuvasongeletsa vanu va chilelo chino kuta vadisile ndongwa ntsibi. Kwasawuli vanu va muji gwa Ninavi vakamupituchilaje Mulungu na kuleka ndongwa tsawo ntsibi, lechelelo iha hana muvina kumulutila muloli Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Muntsajila mudala va inyi ya Seba akwima hamwe na vanu va chilelo chino, nayo akuvasongeletsa kuta vadisile ndongwa ntsibi. Kwasawuli mwene akatsitse kuhuma ku inyi ya kutali ili ahulikitse tselo tsa muntsajila Selemani, na iha hana muvina kulutila muntsajila Selemani.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa misoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Lukasi 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Manyi lisoka livingwe kuhuma kwa munu, liyambaga yambaga hono hagaya malenga ili kusaka hono ha kwesela. Manyi lilemwe kuhawona, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />lilongaga kuta, ngupiluchila mu nyumba yangu yo ngikalaga. Nalyo holikuva lifisile na kuyiwona nyumba yila yifyajilwe na kupambwa finofu, <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />nalyo libitaga kujitegula jiyage jinji saba mibi kulutila lyene, jeka jitsaga kwinjila na kikala mugati mwa munu. Munu uyo avaga mubi kulutila hala hamutalo. Ihyo fyo yikuva kwa vanu va chilelo chino wovan'dita ndongwa ntsibi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuve na vang'olotse va wukweli va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lukasi 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu hoavaga ang'acha anlonga na lilugu lya vanu, yuve hamwe na vang'olotse vakafikaje kivala na vakaganaga kulongana nayo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Munu yumwe akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Yuwo hamwe na vang'olotso vali kivala van'gana kulongana na heve.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu akamulonjelaje munu uyo, “Yuva vangu yo nani? Vang'olotsangu wo vanani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Kaha akavasonelaje chala vadahitswa vake na kulonga, “Iva wo yuva vangu na wo vang'olotsangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kwasawuli munu yoyuve yoan'dita ndongwa kota fyo an'ganaga Dada vangu va Kilanga, uyo yo mung'olotsangu, na yo muhatsa vangu, na kaha uyo yo yuva vangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mumitsi va nyadikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lukasi 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Hambele siku yiyila Yesu akahumaje mu nyumba yila na kubita kikala halubali lwa lilamba lya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Lilugu likomi ndalahela lya vanu likamupilimaje mbaka Yesu akakwinaje mu mutumbwi, na luvalalulo vanu vakimaje mu lubali lwa lilamba ili vamuhulikitse. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Akavadahitsaje ndongwa ntsolofu kwa mihwano. Akavalonjelaje, “Munu yumwe avaga ahele kumitsa nyadikwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Nayo hoavaga am'mitsa nyadikwa, tsinji tsikagwaje mu ng'asi, fideje fikatsaje na kudobola. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Nyadikwa tsinji tsikagwaje mu matalawe kosikwavaga na lilongo lyolofu na simusika tsikawonekaje kota, kwasawuli lilongo lyavaga lidodo, <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />lechelelo hala litsuva ho lyavaga kuvala, tsikakalaje kwasawuli ndela tsavaga muchanyamuchanya hela. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Nyadikwa tsinji tsikagwaje hagati ha mifwa tsikakalagasaje, hambele mifwa ijo hojavaga kukalagala ndalahela, jikatsisumaje. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Nyadikwa tsiji tsikagwaje mu lilongo linofu, tsikotaje na kulela, tsinji tsikalelaje nyadikwa mya, na tsinji sitini, na tsinji salasini!” <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yesu akasindaje kwa kuvalonjela kuta, munu munya mapulichilo ga kuhulichila na ahuliche.<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntsambutso ya kudahitsa kwa mihwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lukasi 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Hambele vakatsaje vadahitswa va Yesu na kumuputsa, “Kwajili ya chichi un'dahitsa kwa mihwano?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, Mulungu avagavye henye nyala tsa kutsitsela ndongwa tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu tso tsing'acha kugubulwa. Lechelelo wo valikivala vanlonjelwa chila chinu kwa mihwano, kwasawuli vene valihela ntselo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kwasawuli yula munya chinu akuwilwa finu finji, lechelelo yula yoalihela chinu akusukulwa mbaka chila chinu cho anacho. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Iyo yo ntsambutso ya kulonga nawo kwa mihwano. Kwasawuli vana miho, lechelelo sinambe valole na vana mapulichilo lechelelo sinambe vahuliche, na kaha sinambe vatsele. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Ihyo tsikwilye ndongwa tso alontsile Isaya muloli va Mulungu kuta, “Vanu iva vakuhulika na kuhulika lechelelo si vakwelewa, na kaha vakulava na kulava, lechelelo si vakuwona.”<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />“Kwasawuli numbula tsa vanu vano tsiveye nalamu kudaha, kwa mapulichilo gawo sinambe vahuliche na kwa miho gawo nambe valole, Muntsajila anlonga hino,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">“Manyi valole kwa miho gawo na kuhulika kwa mapulichilo gawo na kutsela kwa nyala tsawo na kumiluchila heni nguvaponetsa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Lechelelo mutambichilwe henye kwasawuli miho genyu ganlola na mapulichilo genyu ganhulika.” <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Yesu aendelelaje kulonga kuta, “Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, valoli wolofu hamwe na vanu yo van'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, vakiwiniwaga kutsiwona ndongwa itsi tso mungutsiwona. Lechelelo sivatsiwene, na kaha vaganaga kutsihulika lechelelo sivatsihuliche.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dadambula muhwano gwa mumitsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lukasi 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Lelo muhulikitse mana ya muhwano gula gwa mumitsi. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Munu yoyuve yo anhulika lulongwa lwa Mulungu na kaha aleche kulutsela, ihwana na nyadikwa tso tsigweye mu ng'asi, nalyo Lihoka litsaga kutegula chila chochili mu numbula yake. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Nyadikwa tsila tso tsamitsitswe mu matalawe, tsihwana na munu yo ahuliche lulongwa lwa Mulungu na kwanuchila kwa wuhechelelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Lechelelo kwasawuli Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu sitsikalaga mugati mwa numbula, tsikalaga chipindi chidodo hela, manyi kuhumile ng'odeko awu chinu chibi chochive valekaga kumutumbila Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Nyadikwa tso tsamitsitswe mumisati ja mifwa tsinhwana na munu yo ahuliche lulongwa lwa Mulungu, lechelelo muhwehwe na mbwiniwo tsa kugana mali, na mbwiniwo tsinjitsinji tsa finu fya mu inyi tsanangaga ndongwa tsa Mulungu, na ihyo munu anlemwa kudita ndongwa tso an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Nyadikwa yila yo yamitsitswe mu lilongo linofu, yinhwana na munu yo anhulika lulongwa lwa Mulungu na kulutsela nayo ankuva kota wuhemba wowunlela maho, wumwe wunlela maho mya, na wunji wunlela sitini na wunji wunlela salasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa misoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vanu muhwano gunji kuta, “Wuntsajila wa kilanga wihwana na munu yo apandite nyadikwa nofu mu mugunda gwake gwa wuhemba.”<verse eid="MAT 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />“Lechelelo hachilo vanu hovavaga vavasise mutelani vake akatsaje na kuyala mihembahemba hagati ha wuhemba na kuwuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ihyo lelo hambele wuhemba howavaga kukalagala na kwantsa kwalula, mihembahemba najo jikatselanikaje. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Vatantsi va munya mugunda vakabitaje kumuputsa munya mugunda kuta Mutwa, si tukali tumitsitse nyadikwa nofu mu mugunda gwako, ino lelo mihembahemba jihumye kwiya?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Nayo munya mugunda akavalonjelaje, “Mutelani yo ayatsile mihembahemba. Ihyo lelo vatatsi vake vakawilaje kumuputsa kuta un'gana tubite tukajing'ule? <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Nayo akavajibulaje kuta, mujileche kwasawuli manyi mujing'ule mukung'ula mihembahemba na filyo. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Mujileche jikalagale hohamwe mbaka chipindi cha kubeta, iho ho nguvalonjela mujikunje tandi mihembahemba na kujinyanya. Kaha musogole wuhemba na kuwuvika mukano yangu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa nyadikwa ya mubichi gwa muhaladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30">Maliko 4:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lukasi 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu akawilaje kulonga nawo kwa mihwano jinji kuta, “Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwanite na munu yo ategwe nyadikwa ndodo yoyinchemwa haladali na kubita kuyala mu mugunda gwake. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Nyadikwa iyo ya muhaladali nayivaje ndodo kulutila nyadikwa tseka, lechelelo manyi yote na kukalagala yivaga ngomi kulutila mboga tseka, na kuva mubichi mukomi mbaka fideje fya kululanga fitsengaga fifulya mu miputi jake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa hamila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20">Lukasi 13:20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje muhwano gunji kuta, “Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwanite na mudala yumwe yo atweye hamila na kuyihantsa mu madebe gadatu ga wuse wa ngano, na wuse weka wukatunaje.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntsambutso ya kudahitsa kwa mihwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33">Maliko 4:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 4:34">34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu avadahitsaga vanu veka kwa mihwano, na siavadahitsaga chinu chochive bila muhwano. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Adisile ihyo ili lukwile lulongwa loalontsile muloli va Mulungu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ngulongana nawo kwa mihwano, nguvika helu ndongwa tsotsifihilwe kuhuma inyi fyo yawumbitwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dadambula muhwano gwa mihembahemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Hambele Yesu akavalagaje vanu na kwinjila mu nyumba, vadahitswa vake vakamufwataje na kumuputsa, “Utudadambulile gula muhwano gwa mihembahemba ja kumugunda.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muyali va tsila nyadikwa nofu yo Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Gula mugunda yo inyi. Nyadikwa nofu wo vanu vala va Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. Lechelelo mihembahemba wo vanu vala va Lihoka <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Yula mutelani yoayatsile mihembahemba lyo Lihoka. Chipindi cha kubeta cho chipindi cha wudugo wa inyi, na vala vabetaji wo vatantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Kota hila mihembahemba fyo jikungwaga na kunyanywa mumoto, ho hihyo fyo yikuva hachipindi cha wudugo wa inyi. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana va Munu akuvalajitsa vatantsi vake va kilanga, nawo vakuvakong'asa kuhuma mu Wuntsajila wake vanu vala wovanguvambutsa vanu vadite ndongwa ntsibi, hamwe na vala veka wovan'dita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Nawo vakutagwa mumoto mukali gwa siku tseka go sigutsimikaga, uko ko vakuvemba na kugwegwetsula mino. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ihyo, vala wo van'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu wakuvala kota litsuva mu Wuntsajila wa Dada vawo.” Yesu akasindaje kwa kuvalonjela kuta, munya mapulichilo ga kuhulichila na ahuliche.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa chinu cha galama chochifihilwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwana na chinu cha galama ngomi chochifilwe mu mugunda. Munu yumwe akachiwonaje chinu icho akahechelelaje ndala hela na kuchifiha, akabitaje kugutsa finu fyeka fyoavaga nafyo ili akagule mugunda gula.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuhwano gwa chinu cha galama ngomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Kaha Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwana na munu yumwe yo asakaga chinu cha galama ngomi cho chinchemwa lulu.<verse eid="MAT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Hoavaga kuyipata lulu yimwe ya galama ngomi, akagutsaje chila chinu cho avaga nacho akabitaje kuyigula.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga nyafu tsa kulovela somba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Kaha Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwana na waafu wo wutotsitswe mu lilamba na wukagwilitsaje somba tsa chila ayina. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Wafu howavaga kumema valovi vakawukwejelaje kulubali, vakikalisaje na kuhagula somba nofu vakatsisopaje mu mutumbwi gwawo, na jila mitsumbuli vakajidibulaje.<verse eid="MAT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Hohihyo fyo yikuva ha wudugo wa inyi. Vatantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu ho vakutsa kuvabagula vanu wovan'dita ndongwa ntsibi na wovan'dita ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Nawo vanu wovan'dita ndongwa ntsibi vakavatagaje mulitanuli lya mumoto mukali gwa siku tseka go sigutsimikaga, uko kovakuvemba na kugwegwetsula mino.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga sambi na ga katali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu akavaputsaje vadahitswa vake kuta, “Mbe, mungutselewa ndongwa itsi tseka?” Vakamujibulaje kuta, “Ena tungutselewa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kaha, “Ihyo lelo, chila mudahitsi va malajitso ga Musa yo ampituka kuva mudahitswa va Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, ihwana na munya nyumba yo antola muhachiba yake finu fipya na fya katali.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankanwa ku Natsaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lukasi 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso kwa mihwano ijo, akawukaje hono iho, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />akabitaje ku Natsaleti uko kogwavaga muji go akalagalye. Uko akavadahitsaje vanu mu kaye ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, chila munu akapomokaje na kulonga hino, “Yuno apasile kwiya luhala luno na wuvetso wa kudita ndongwa tsino tsa ndajilo?” <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />“Mbe, yuno si yoyula mwana va Muselemala yo tumutsele? Yuve si yoyula yo anchemwa Maliyamu? Mung'olotsawo va Yakobo, na Yusufu, na Simoni hamwe na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Mbe, vahatsave si tulihamwe nawo bahanago? Lelo apasile kwiya ndongwa tsino tseka?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ihyo vakavaje tebe nayo na kuleka kumutumba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muloli va Mulungu ahesimilwaga chila hono, lechelelo abedalwaga na vanu va mu kaye yake hamwe na vang'olotse.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Ihyo, si adisile ndajilo myolofu uko, kwasawuli valemile kumutumba.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Chifo cha Yohana Mubatitsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lukasi 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Chipindi icho muntsajila Helode va ku Galilaya, avaga kuhulika ndongwa tsa Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />akavalonjelaje vatantsi vake kuta, “Munu yuno yo Yohana mubatitsi atsilipuche, ihyo wuvetso wa Yohana wo wun'dita ndajilo mugati mwake” <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Helode yo avaga amubite Yohana na kumuvika munyumba ya vawopwa kwasawuli ya Helodiya yo avaga mudala va Fwilipo mung'olotse. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kwasawuli chila chipindi Yohana avaga angumulonjela Helode kuta, “Siyo finofu heve kumutola mudala va mung'olotso.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helode akaganaga kumukopola Yohana, lechelelo awogopaga vanu, kwasawuli vanu vamutumbaga Yohana kuta avaga Muloli va Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Hoyavaga kufika siku ya liwungo lya kuleleka kwa Helode, muhintsa va Helodiya akawungaje finofu halutalo ha vajentsi. Helode akahechelelaje ndalahela, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />mbaka akilahaje kuta akumupela muhintsa uyo chochive cho akugana. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Muhintsa uyo avaga adahitswe na yuve hila fyo akumulonjela Helode ihyo akalongaje, “Umele sambi mu luhelo luno mutwi gwa Yohana Mubatitsi.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Muntsajila Helodi akakalalaje ndalahela lechelelo kwasawuli ya kwilaha koali ilahite na vajentsi vake wovavaga hala ha liwungo, akalajitsaje kuta apelwe cho an'gana. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Ihyo Helode akamutumaje mwimilitsi abite munyumba ya vawopwa akamudumule mutwi Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Mutwi gwa Yohana gukaletwaje mu luhelo, akapelwaje yula muhintsa, nayo akamusindichilaje yuve. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Vadahitswa va Yohana vakatsaje kutegula mayiti ga Yohana na kugatsika. Kahi vakabitaje kumulonjela Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvapela chilyo vanu kulutila elufu tsihanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lukasi 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa tso tsamupasile Yohana akakwinaje mutumbwi na kuwuka, akabitaje hono ho haduhu munu yoyuve. Lechelelo vanu hovavaga kutsela vakahumaje ku miji jawo kwa magulu vakakolaje mulubali lwa lulenga kubita hono hoavaga Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yesu hoavaga kwika mu mutumbwi akavawonaje vanu wolofu, akawawonelaje lusungu, ihyo akavaponetsaje namwa tsawo. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Hoyavaga kufika mumihe vadahitswa vake vakamufwataje na kumulonjela Yesu, “Hono hano hali mbuga ng'ani na litsuva lihele, lelo uvalaje vanu iva vabite vakigulile chilyo ili valye.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Sivan'ganika kuwuka, lechelelo mun'ganika henye muvapele filyo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Vene vakamulonjelaje, “Hano hogali mabumunda gahanu na somba tsivili hela.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mundetele hano.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Akavalonjelaje vanu vikale hasi mu misoli, Yesu akategulaje gala mabumunda gahanu na tsila somba tsivili, akagalamaje Kilanga na kumulumba Mulungu. Kaha akamegasaje gala mabumunda na somba tsila na kuvapela vadahitswa vake, nawo vakavapelaje vanu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Vanu veka vakalyaje na kwiguta. Hambele vadahitswa vakaholaje filyo fyo fisije na fikamemaje fitangula kumi na fivili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Vanu veka wovalyeye vavaga vafisile valume elufu tsihanu bila kuvavala vadala na vana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'jnda mwilanga mwa malenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yohana 6:16-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Luvalalulo Yesu akavalajitsaje vadahitswa vake vakwine mu mutumbwi kulongola kubita kumwambu gwa lilamba hala mwene hoavaga anguvalaga vanu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kuvalaga vanu akakwinaje kuchidunda kumusuka Mulungu. Akavaje kuko aliyeka mbaka chilo chikafikaje. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Chipindi icho mutumbwi gwavaga habehi na hagati na gati ha lilamba kuno gun'yugayuga kwasawuli ya mavimbi na ng'ala ngomi.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Hokwavaga kufika hachilo cha kuvika ntsogolo, Yesu akabitaje kwa vadahitswa vake kuno an'jnda mwilanga mwa malenga. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Vadahitswa vake ho vavaga kumuwona Yesu an'jenda mwilanga mwa malenga, vakavaje na muhwehwe vakatijilaje kuta, “Ilino Lilayika, vakantsaje kukola kwa muloto.” <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mwikangatse muleche kuva na muloto, yo heni.” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Mutwa, manyi yo heve undajitse ntsitse kwa heve kuno ntsin'jenda mwilanga mwa malenga.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ale! Utse.” Ihyo Petulo akikaje mu mutumbwi na kujenda mwilanga mwa malenga na kubita kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Lechelelo Petulo hoavaga kuyiwona yila ng'ala ngomi akavaje na muloto, akantsaje kudidimila mu malenga. Akakolaje kuta, “Mutwa ung'uluse!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Luvalalulo Yesu akagololaje liwoko lyake akamubataje na kumulonjela, “Heve munya litumbilo lidodo kwasawuli ya chichi wawene muhwehwe?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Kahi Yesu na Petulo vakakwinasaje mu mtumbwi na ng'ala yila yikakatukaje. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Vadahitswa veka wo vavaga mu mutumbwi vakafugamaje na kumuhonamila Yesu na kumulonjela kuta, “Wukweli heve uli mwana va Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vatamwa kuinyi ya Genetsaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliko 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Hovavaga kulowoka lilamba, vakafikaje ku inyi ya Genetsaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Vanu va hono hala hovavaga kumuwona, vakamutselaje kuta yo Yesu, vakatagalitsaje ndongwa ku miji jo jilihabehi na hono hala. Nawo vanu vakamuletelaje vatamwa vawo veka, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />nawo vakamugongolaje Yesu avalechele vatamwa vamudometse nambe lupembo lwa mwenda gwake, na veka wo vamudomitse vakaponaje.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Madahitso kuhuma kwa vakuku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliko 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Kaha Vafwalisayo vamwe hamwe na vadahitsi va malagitso ga Musa kuhuma ku muji gwa Yelusalemu, vakabitaje kwa Yesu na kumulonjela, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Mbe, kwasawuli yachi vadahitswa vako sinambe vafwate ntsovelo tsa vavina, kwakuva vankulya bila kukalava mawoko kota fyo yin'ganika?” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Kwasawuli yachi na henye mungugabedala madahitso ga Mulungu na kibata madahitso genyu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kwasawuli Mulungu alontsile kuta, walahogola kuvabedala dado na yuwo, na munu yoyuve yoakumuliga dade na yuve ang'anika akopolwe. <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Lechelelo henye mudahitsaga vanu kuta, manyi munu ana chinu chochive choagana kumutanga dade awu yuve chinu cho uganije kumupela Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />henye mun'dahitsa munu uyo sian'ganika kumuhesimila dade na yuve ihyo ho munguwubedala lulongwa lwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Henye vapunganitsi, Isaya muloli va Mulungu mwanga ali alagwe ndongwa tsenyu kuta”<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />Mulungu anlonga, “Vanu vano vanyesimilaga kumilomo hela, lechelelo numbula tsawo tsilikutali na heni.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kufugamila kwawo kuli bule hela, natso ndongwa tsawo tso malajitso ga vanu hela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsotsifuluche tsimudite munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliko 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu akagachemaje gala malugu ga vanu na kuvalonjela, “Munyulikitse na muntselewe. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ndongwa tsotsifuluche tsimudite munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu sindongwa tso tsinjilaga kumulomo gwake, lechelelo ndongwa tso tsihumaga kumulomo gwake, itso tso tsimuditaga munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ihyo vadahitswa vake vakamubitilaje na kumulonjela, “Un'tsela kuta Vafwalisayo vakavifile ndalahela hovavaga kuhulika hila fyo ukalontsile lulongwa lula?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Chinu chochive manyi chive sichayatsilwe na Dada vangu va Kilanga, chikukulwa! <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Muvaleche, iwo filongotsi fibofu wo vanlongotsa fibofu, ihyo chibofu manyi amulongotse chibofu muyage, iwo veka vakwinjila mu lyowo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petulo akalongaje, “Utulonjele muhwano ugo guna mana yachi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Mbe, na henye si nambe mutsele lulongwa luno? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Mbe, sinambe mutsele chila chinu cho chinkola mumulomo chibitaga mwileme na hambele chihumaga na kubita kucholo? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Lechelelo ndongwa tso tsinhuma kumulomo, itso tsihumaga kunumbula na igo go gamuditaga munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kwasawuli mu numbula gahumaga mahotso mabi kota hila, kukopola, na waafu, na mbwiniwo tsa waafu, na wuhitsi, na wudesi, na wusongeletsi. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ndongwa itso tsimuditaga munu ave mwaafu, lechelelo kulya bila kukalava, si kumuditaga munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litumbilo lya mudala yumwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliko 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Hambele Yesu akawukaje hono hala, akabitaje ku miji ja Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mudala yumwe yo ikalaga hono iho na yosiavaga Muyawudi akakolaje kwa litsi likomi kuta, “Mutwa, Mwana va Dawudi, unyulumile! Kwasawuli muhintsa vangu ankodwa ndalahela na misoka.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Lechelelo Yesu siakamujibwe lulongwa loluve, ihyo vadahitswa vake vakabitaje na kumugongola ndalahela vakalongaje, “Mulonjele abite, kwasawuli angututifya kwa chiyove” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mulungu si anumile kokuve, ila kwa vanu va Isilaheli wovayatsile kota ng'olo tsotsiyatsile.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Lechelelo yula mudala akatsaje, akafugalaje halutalo ha Yesu na kulonga, “Mutwa dedede, ntsinsuka unanje!” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu akamujibulaje, “Si finofu ndaya kutegula chilyo cha vana na kujitotsela mibwa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Mudala yula akamujibulaje Yesu kuta, “Nachene Mutwa, lechelelo nambe mibwa jilyaga filyo fyofigwaga hametsa ya muvina vawo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Ihyo Yesu akamulonjelaje yula mudala, “Litumbilo lyako likomi, na yivaje hihyo kwako kota fyo un'gana.” Luvalalulo yula muhintsa akaponaje.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu wolofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu akawukaje hala na kubita habehi na lilamba lya Galilaya, akakwinaje kuchidunda na akikalisaje kuko. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Vanu wolofu vakamufwataje, na kumusindichila vanu filema, na fivete, na fibofu, na vatamwa vanji wolofu, vakavavikaje halutalo hake, nayo Yesu akavaponetsaje. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Vanu vala vakapomokaje ndalahela, hala hovavaga kuvawona vabubwi vanlonga, na filema vamponetswa, na fiteve van'jenda na fibofu vanlola, vakamutsumitsaje Mulungu va Isilaheli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvapela filyo vanu elufu tsitayi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliko 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Kaha Yesu akavachemaje vadahitswa vake na kuvalonjela, “Ntsinguvawonela lusungu vanu vano kwasawuli vaveye hamwe na heni kwa siku tsidatu, na sambi valihela chilyo chochive cha kulya. Ndema kuvalaga na kuno vana ntsala, vafuluche vatowe na mbupulu mu ng'asi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Vadahitswa vake vakamulonjelaje, “Tukupata kwiya chilyo cha kuvakwila vanu vano veka na hono hano tuli ha mbuga?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Muna mabumunda galinga?” Nawo vakamulonjelaje, “Mabumunda saba na tusomba tutunga hela.” <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Lelo Yesu akavalonjelaje vanu veka vikalise hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Akategulaje mabumunda gala na somba tsila, akamulumbaje Mulungu, hoavaga kusinda, akavapelaje vadahitswa vake nawo vakavagavasilaje vanu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Vanu veka vakalyaje na kiguta, hambele vadahitswa vake vakakong'osaje fyo fisije vakafimemyaje fitangula saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Veka wovalyeye vavaga valume elfu tsitayi, bila kuvavalila vadala na vana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Yesu akavalagaje vanu na kukwina mu mutumbwi akabitaje hono ho hanchemwa Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Vanu van'gana ndongwa tsa ndajilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Lukasi 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Vafwalisayo hamwe na Vasadukayo vakabitaje kwa Yesu kumujela kwa kumusuka avalajile ndongwa tsa ndajilo kuhuma Kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Manyi yifiche hamihe henye mulongaga, mitondo kukuva finofu kwasawuli lulanga luveye ludung'u. <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Hamilawu mulongaga kuta, munyi guno kukuva na ng'ala ngomi kwasawuli lulanga ludung'u na mafuluka gatandite. Henye mufitsele kulava fipindi kwa kulola lulanga fyoluli, lechelelo munlemwa kutsela ndongwa tso tsinhumila sambi tsina mana yachi. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Chilelo chino chibi chochinsaka ndongwa tsa ndajilo, ino lelo sichikupelwa, lechelelo ndongwa ya mutinuso gwa Yona ng'ani.” Yesu akavalekaje akibitilaje.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Vafwalisayo na Vasadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliko 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Vadahitswa vake hovavaga kulowoka ku mwambu gwa lilamba, vakatselaje kuta vasemwe kutegula mabumunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mwiyangalilaje na hamila ya Vafwalisayo na Vasadukayo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Vakantsaje kulongana vene kwa vene, “Yesu anlonga ihyo kwasawuli tusemwe kutegula mabumunda.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu akatselaje chovanlongana ihyo akavaputsaje, “Henye vanu vanya litumbilo lidodo! Mbona munlongana kuta ndawuli simulategula mabumunda? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Mbe, Mung'ali kutsela? Mbe, musemwe mabumunda gala gahanu gakwilye kulya vanu elfu tsihanu? Mbe, mwakong'ise fitangula filinga fya filyo fyofyasije? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Awu gala mabumunda saba gogakwilye kulya vanu vala elfu tsitayi nafyo mwakong'ise fitangula filinga fya filyo fyofyasije? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Yikuva ndawuli sinambe mutsele kuta si ndongije ndongwa tsa mabumunda? Lechelelo cho ndongije kuta, mwiyangalile na madahitso mabi ga Vafwalisayo na Vasadukayo!” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ihyo vadahitswa vake hovakatselaje kuta, siavalonjelaga viyangalile na Vafwalisayo na Vasadukayo na siyo na hamila na mabumunda, ila viyangalile na madahitso mabi.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo anlonga kuta Yesu yo Mwana va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lukasi 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake hovavaga lubali lwa ku Kayisalia Fwilipi, akavaputsaje, “Vanu vanlonga kuta Mwana va Munu yo nani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Vakamujibulaje, “Vanji vanlonga kuta yo Yohana Mubatitsi, na vanji valongaga kuta yo Eliya, na vanji kuta yo Yelemiya awu yumwe va valoli va Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Henye munlonga kuta heni yo nani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petulo akajibulaje kuta, “Heve yo Chilisito Mukulusi, Mwana va Mulungu yo mumi.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu nayo akamulonjelaje, “Utambichilwe heve Simoni mwana va Yona, lulongwa ulo si akugubulye munu yoyuve, ila akugubulye Dada vangu va Kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Yesu akawilaje kulonga kuta, heve yo Petulo, na mwilanga mwa litalawe lino nguchivika chikundi cha vanu wo vangumutumba Chilisito, na wuvetso wa Lihoka siwukuchisuma. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Heni ngukupela fungulo tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu na chinu chochive cho ukuchidinda mu inyi, chikuva chidindilwe na Kilanga, na kaha chinu chochive cho ukuchidindula mu inyi, chikuva chidinduche na Kilanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Ihyo Yesu akavalemetsaje ndalahela vadahitswa vake valeche kumulonjela munu yoyuve kuta mwene yo Chilisito muhagulwa.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga ndongwa tsa kufwa na kutsilipuka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maliko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lukasi 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kuhuma luvala ulo Yesu akantsaje kuvalonjela vadahitswa vake kuta, “Ntsin'ganika kubita ku muji gwa Yelusalemu, uko ngupata ng'odeko ntsolofu kwa vavina va vatawula nambiko, na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, vakung'opola lechelelo siku ya kadatu ngutsilipuka.” <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Petulo akamukwegaje Yesu halubali na akantsaje kumung'anulila akalongaje, “Ndaya Mutwa! Lulongwa ulo silukukupata” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yesu akapitukaje na kumulonjela Petulo kuta, “Uwuche halutalo hangu, Lihoka! Heve yo uli chitindilivasi kwa heni. Mahotso gako si ganhuma kwa Mulungu, lechelelo unhotsa mahotso ga chiwunu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Munu yoyuve manyi an'gana ave mudahitswa vangu, yin'ganika aleche kihotsela mwene, na kitwika musalaba gwake na afwate heni. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kwasawuli munu yoyuve yo an'gana kuwukulusa wumi wake, uyo akuwuyatsa. Lechelelo munu yoyuve yo akuwuyatsa wumi wake kwasawuli ya heni, uyo akuwukulusa. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Mbe, munu akupata chichi manyi apate finu fyeka fya muinyi na kuno awuyatsitse wumi wake? Awu akutawula chinu chachi chive badili ya wumi wake? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kwasawuli Mwana va Munu akutsa mu wumelemo wa Dade hamwe na vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, na ihyo ho akumuhomba chila munu kota fyo adisile ndongwa tsake. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, vamwe venyu hono hano sivafuluche vafwe mbaka hovakumuwona Mwana va Munu ho akuva ankutsa mu Wuntsajila wake.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu an'galuka kumiho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lukasi 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku sita, Yesu akavatolaje Petulo, na Yohana hamwe na Yakobo mung'olotse, akabitaje nawo kuchanya ku chidunda chitali. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Kuko Yesu akagalukaje kumiho kwake halutalo hawo, kumiho kwake kukamelemaje kota litsuva na myenda jake jikavaje jimmelema tswee, kota mwangatsa gwa wumeme. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Luvala lulo vakahumilaje Musa na Eliya, vakavaga vanlongana nayo. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Iho Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Mutwa, yika kuva finofu twikale hano, manyi ugane ngutsenga fyuwo fidatu, chimwe cha heve, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Petulo hoavaga anlonga ihyo, lifuluka lyolyamelemaga likavagubikaje nawo vakahulikaje litsi kuhuma ku lifuluka linlonga, “Yuno yo Mwana va heni yo ntsimuganile, mun'ganika mumuhulikitse!” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Vadahitswa vake hovavaga kuhulika litsi ilyo vakagwaje chinyakipuna kuno vamemile muloto. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu akabitaje akavadometsaje na kuvalonjela, “Mwinuche na muleche kuva na muloto.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Lechelelo hovavaga kugubula miho gawo, sivamuwene munu yunji ila vakamuwonaje Yesu ng'ani. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ihyo hovavaga van'kwika kuhuma ku chidunda, Yesu akavalemetsaje, “Muleche kumulonjela munu ndongwa tso mutsiwene mbaka Mwana va Munu ho akuvakutsilipuka.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Vala vadahitswa vakamuputsaje, “Mbe, kwasawuli yachi vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa valongaga kuta yin'ganika Eliya atse tandi?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Kweli, Eliya akutsa tandi ili kuvika finofu ndongwa tseka. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjela kuta, Eliya mwanga atsitse, nawo sivakamutselye, nawo vamudisile kota fyo van'gana. Ihyo Mwana va Munu vakumuditila hihyo mu mawoko gawo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Iho vala vadahitswa vakatselaje kuta anlonga ndongwa tsa Yohana Mubatitsi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa mukwamitsi munya misoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Lukasi 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Hovavaga kufika hono ha vanu wolofu, munu yumwe akabitaje kwa Yesu na kumufugamila, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />yula munu akalongaje, “Mutwa, ntsinsuka umuwonele lusungu mwanangu mukwamitsi, kwasawuli ankodeka ndalahela kwa namwa ya chintsilisa, na mala ntsolofu agwaga mu moto awu mu lulenga. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ntsimuletite kwa vadahitswa vako, lechelelo valemulwe kumuponetsa.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Henye chilelo cho chigaya litumbilo na chochin'dita wubi! Ngikala na henye mbaka hanili? Nguvafumilila mbaka hanili? Mumulete hano uyo mwana.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu akaling'anulilaje lila lisoka, nalyo likahegaje, na luvala lulo mwana yula akaponaje. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Kaha vadahitswa vake vakabitaje kwa Yesu hala hoavaga aliyena vakamuputsaje, “Kwasawuli yachi hetwe tulemilwe kulihetsa lisoka lila?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Kwasawuli mwavaga na litumbilo lidodo. Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta manyi muve na litumbilo lidodo kota nyadikwa ya haladali, mufuluche muchilonjele chidunda chino kuta, wuche hano ubite kula, nacho chikubita na kuduhu chinu chochive cho mukulemwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Lisoka linya hila si lihegaga hihi hela, lechelelo lihegaga kwa kuleka kulya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'wila kulonga ndongwa tsa kutajika na kutsilipuka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Lukasi 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Vadahitswa hovavaga vakong'ine hamwe ku Galilaya, Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mwana va Munu akibatika na kusindikwa kwa vanu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />nawo vakumukopola, lechelelo siku ya kadatu akutsilipuka.” Vadahitswa vake vakasusutalaje ndalahela.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhomba kodi mu Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Hovavaga kufika ku muji gwa Kalipenaumu, vanu yo vavaga vankongotsa kodi ya Nyumba ya Mulungu vakabitaje kwa Petulo na kumuputsa kuta, “Mbe, mudahitsi venyu ahombaga kodi ya Nyumba ya Mulungu?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petulo akajibulaje, “Ee, ahombaga.” Petulo hoavaga kuwuya kukaye, Yesu akatalaje kumuputsa kuta, “Simoni, heve un'wona ndawuli? Vantsajila va inyi vakongotsaga kodi kuhuma kwa nani? Mbe, vakong'asaga kuhuma kwa vanu vawo awu kwa vajentsi?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petulo akamujibulaje, “Vakong'asaga kuhuma kwa vajentsi!” Nayo Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ihyo lelo yiganikaga vanu vake valeche kutawula kodi nda! <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Lechelelo tuleche kuvatifya, bite ku lilamba ukateje ndovano. Somba ndongola yo yikugwila, uyigubule mulomo ukuliwona ligobole, na utegule ligobole ilyo ukahombe kodi yako na ya heni.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Nani yo muvina ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lukasi 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Luvala lulo vadahitswa vake vakabitaje kwa Yesu vakamuputsaje kuta, “Nani yo muvina ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu akamuchemaje mwana yumwe na kumuvika hagati hao akalongaje, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />“Ntsinkuvalonjela wukweli kuta, manyi muleche kugaluka kuhuma mu ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi, na kuva kota vana vadodo, nachene simukwinjila ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Munu yoyuve yo akwika kota mwana yuno, yo akuva muvina kulutila veka ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Munu yoyuve yo akumulibulitsa mwana mudodo kota yuno kwasawuli yangu, akuva andibulitse heni.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tso tsambutsaga munu kudita ndongwa ntsibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lukasi 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Manyi munu yoyuve amwambutse yumwe va vadodo vano vanya litumbilo adite ndongwa ntsibi, yika kuva chiba awopelwe lwala lukomi lwa kuhalulila mu singo yake na kutotswa ha ndimbo nali ya malenga. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Vakudutsa vanu va muinyi kwasawuli ya kudita ndongwa tso tsinkwambutsa vanu yo vangumutumbila Chilisito vadite ndongwa ntsibi. Ndongwa tso tsinkwambutsa vanu vadite ndongwa ntsibi tsin'ganika tsihumile, lechelelo akudutsa yula yo akwambutsa vanu vadite ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Manyi liwoko awu ligulu lyako lingukwambutsa udite ndongwa ntsibi, udumule na utotse kutali. Yikuva chiba kwaheve kwinjila ku wumi kuno ulihela liwoko awu ligulu limwe, kuliko uve na mawoko awu magulu geka na kutagwa ku moto mukali go sigutsimikaga siku tseka. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Manyi liho lyako lingukwambutsa udite ndongwa ntsibi, likolopole na kulidibula kutali. Yikuva chiba kwaheve kwinjila ku wumi kuno ulihela liho limwe, kuliko kuva na miho gega gavili na ukatagwe ku moto mukali go sigutsimikaga siku tseka.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa ng'olo yoyiyatsile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Lukasi 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Mwiyangalilaje, muleche kumubedala nambe yumwe va vadodo vano, kwasawuli ntsinguvalonjela kuta, “Vatantsi va Kilanga kwa Mulungu siku tseka valihamwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kwasawuli Mwana va Munu akatsitse kuvakulusa vala veka wo vangikala kota vayatsile. <verse eid="MAT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Mun'wona ndawuli? Manyi munu ave na ng'olo mya moja lechelelo ng'olo yimwe yiyaje, siakutsileka tsila tisini na tisa kuchidunda na kubita kuyisaka ng'olo yimwe yoyiyatsile? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, manyi ayipate akuhechelela kwasawuli ya ng'olo yimwe kulutila tsila tisini na tisa tso tsivayatsile. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Hohihyo na Dada venyu va Kilanga si aganaga nambe yumwe va vadodo vano ayaje.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumutanga mung'olotso ho an'dita ndongwa ntsibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Manyi mung'olotso akuditile lulongwa lubi, ubite ukamulonjele wubi wake homuvavili heve na mwene. Manyi akuhulikitse ukuva umupasile mung'olotso. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Lechelelo manyi aleche kukuhulikitsa, utegule munu yumwe awu vavili, kwasawuli kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, lulongwa ludichilwaga kwa wusahidi wa vanu vavili awu vadatu nongwa yilamulwaga. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Manyi aleme kuvahulikitsa ivo, uchilonjele chikundi cha vanu vanya litumbilo, nayo manyi aleme kuvahulikitsa, duve munu uyo mumuvalile kota munu mugaya litumbilo awu mukongotsa kodi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulema na kidichila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, chinu cho chive cho mukulemetsa mu inyi, icho chikuva chilemitswe na Kilanga kwa Mulungu, na chinu cho chive cho mukuchidichila mu inyi chikuva chidichilwe na Kilanga kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Kahi ntsinguvalonjela, manyi vanu vavili vakulagana mu inyi kwasawuli ya lulongwa loluve lo van'gana kusuka, Dada vangu va Kilanga akuvaditila lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kwasawuli hala ho vakukong'ana vanu vavili awu vadatu kwasawuli yangu, na heni nguva baho hamwe nawo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mutantsi yo alihela lusungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Kahi Petulo akabitaje kwa Yesu na kumuputsa, “Mutwa, manyi mung'olotsangu ankwendelela kunditila wubi, ntsin'ganika ntsimuhulumile mala kalinga? Mbe nambe mala saba?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu akamujibulaje, “Sintsingukulonjela kuta mala saba hela, lechelelo muhulumilaje nambe saba mala sabini.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />“Ihyo Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wufuluche wiganitswe na muntsajila yumwe yo aganaga kuvala hisabu tsake na vatantsi vake. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Hoavaga ankwantsa kuvala nawo hisabu tsake, vakamuletelaje munu yumwe yo adayilwaga magobole mongofu. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Munu uyo avaga alihela cha kuhomba lideni ilyo, muntsajila vake akalajitsaje kuta agutswe mwene hamwe na mudala vake, na vanage, na finu fyeka fyo avaga nafyo ili kulihomba lideni ilyo. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Yula mutantsi akafugamaje halutalo ha muntsajila uyo na kumugongola kuta, ntsinsuka dedede untsinde tandi, hambele ngukuhomba lideni lyako lyeka. <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Yula muntsajila va mutantsi yula akamuwonelaje lusungu, akamuhulumilaje lideni lyeka na kumuleka abite.” <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Lechelelo yula mutantsi, hoavaga anhuma kivala akamuwonaje mutantsi muyage yoavaga angumudaya magobole machefu hela. Ino mwene akamudingaje kusingo na kumulonjela, unyombe magobole gangu go ntsingukudaya! <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Yula mutantsi muyage akamufugamilaje na kumugongoletsa na kumulonjela kuta, ntsingukugongola dedede untsinde, hambele ngukuhomba lideni lyako. <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Lechelelo mwene akalemaje, akamutegulaje na kumudindila mu nyumba ya vawopwa mbaka hala ho akulihomba ilyo lideni lyeka. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Vatantsi vayage hovavaga kutsiwona ndongwa tso tsihumye vakavipaje ndalahela, na kubita kumulonjela muntsajila ndongwa itso. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Yula muntsajila akamuchemaje yula mutantsi na kumulonjela, heve uli mutantsi munya wubi! Heni ngakuwon'ye lusungu lideni lyako ho ukangongolitse. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Mbe, na heve si uganikije kumuwonela lusungu mutantsi muyago kota heni fyo ngakuwun'ye lusungu? <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Duve kwa lilakali likomi, muntsajila yula akamusindikaje kwa vimilitsi va nyumba ya vawopwa ili akodwe mbaka hala ho akuhomba lideni lyeka lyo adayilwaga.” <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yesu akasindaje kwa kulonga kuta, “Ho hihyo Dada vangu va Kilanga fyo akuvaditilani henye, manyi muleche kuvahulumila vanu wo vakuvaditila ndongwa ntsibi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga ndongwa tsa kulekana kwa munu na vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliko 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso, akawukaje kuhuma ku Galilaya na kubita ku muji gwa Yudeya mwambu gwa lulenga lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Vanu wolofu vakamufwataje kuko, nayo akavaponetsaje. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Vafwalisayo vamwe vakatsaje kwa Yesu ili vamujele, “Mbe, yin'ganika mulume kumuleka mudala vake kwasawuli ya lulongwa loluve hela?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Mbe simukasomile mu Maandiko ga Mulungu kuta, kuhuma katali avawumbite munu mulume na munu mudala? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Nayo Mulungu alontsile kuta, kwasawuli ya ihyo, munu akumuleka dade na yuve akihudikitsa hamwe na mudala vake, na ivo vavili vakuva muvili gumwe. <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Ihyo si vakuva vavili kaha, lechelelo vakuva muvili gumwe. Kwasawuli iyo cho achihudikitse Mulungu, munu alekaje kuchihudula.” <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Kaha Vafwalisayo vakamuputsaje, “Kwasawuli ya chichi Musa akalajitse munu amupele mudala vake baluva ya kumuleka mudala vake?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Musa avadichilye mwileche na vadala venyu kwasawuli henye mulivatalamu kudahitsika. Lechelelo kuhuma hamutalo lulongwa ulo silwavaga hihyo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Heni ntsinguvalonjelani kuta munu yoyuve yo akumuleka mudala vake kwa lulongwa loluve na siyo kwa mbwiniyo tsa waafu, na kumutola mudala yunji akuva an'dita waafu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Vadahitswa vake vakamulonjelaje, “Manyi lulongwa lwa kutolana luli ihyo, chiba munu ikale bila kutola.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Siyo vanu veka wo vafuluche kuludichila lulongwa luno, lechelelo wo vala ng'ani Mulungu wo avagavye. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kwasawuli vanu vamwe vaveye vachiliti kwasawuli valeliche hihyo, na vanji vadisilwe na vanu vave vachiliti, na vamwe valamwe vene vave vachiliti kwasawuli ya Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. Mwene yo akuvetsa kuludichila lulongwa luno aludichile.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvatambichila vana vadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lukasi 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Kaha vanu vamwe vakamusindichilaje Yesu vana vadodo ili avavichile mawoko gake mumitwi jawo na kuvatambichila. Lechelelo vadahitswa vake vakavang'anulilaje vala vanu. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake kuta, “Muvaleche vana vadodo vatse kwa heni, mwalahogola kuvalemetsa kwasawuli Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wo wavala vanu wo vanakota vana vano.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Yesu akavavichilaje mawoko gake mwilanga mwawo, akawukaje hono hala.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukwamitsi yo avaga mufuchifu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lukasi 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Munu yumwe mukwamitsi yoavaga mufuchifu akabitaje kwa Yesu na kumuputsa kuta, “Mudahitsi muwuya, nditaje lulongwa lwachi ili mate wumi wugaya wudugo?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Mbona un'nyema heni kuta ntsi muwuya? Kuduhu muwuya lechelelo yumwe yo Mulungu ng'ani. Lechelelo manyi un'gana kuwupata wumi un'ganika ugahulikitse malajitso ga Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Yula munu akamuputsaje? “Malajitso gachi?” Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Walahogola kukopola, walahogola kudita waafu, walahogola kuhitsa, wahogola kulonga wudesi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Uvahulikitsaje dado na yuwo na umuganaje muyago kota hila fyo ungigana heve.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Yula mukwamitsi mufuchifu akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Malajitso geka ntsigabite, lelo ndite chinu chachi kahi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Manyi un'gana muwuya nachene, un'ganika ubite ukagutse finu fyako fyeka na magobole igo go ukugapata ukavapele vagayu, ihyo hohave ukuva na hachiba Kilanga kwa Mulungu na utse ufwate heni.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Yula mukwamitsi mufuchifu hoavaga kuhulika ihyo akawukaje kwa wususutalo kwasawuli avaga na finu fyolofu.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, kukuva na wutalamu kwa munu mufuchifu kwinjila ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Ntsinguvalonjela kahi, kukuva na wupefu kwa linyama likomi lyolinchemwa ngamiya kupuluta mukanang'ana ka sing'ano kuliko munu mufuchifu kwinjila ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Vadahitswa vake hovavaga kuhulika ihyo, vakapomokaje ndalahela na kiputsa kuta, “Mbe, kwa lulongwa luno munu vachi yo akuvetsa kukuluka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu akavakangatsilaje miho na kuvalonjela, “Lulongwa luno lukuva lutalamu kwa vanu, lechelelo ndongwa tseka tsivaga mefu kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Kaha Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Ulave hetwe tulesile finu fyeka na tukufwatite heve, ino lelo tukupata chinu chachi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu akajibulaje, “Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta chipindi cha inyi ntsipya, hala Mwana va Munu ho akikala mu chigoda chake cha Wuntsajila cho chim'melema, henye yo mwamufwataga mukikala mu figoda kumi na fivili fya chintsajila, na mukutsihiga kabila kumi na tsivili tsa vanu va Isilaheli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Chila munu yo alesile nyumba awu vang'olotse mulume awu vadada awu yuve awu migunda kwasawuli ya heni, akwanuchila mala mya na kulutila, na akupata wumi wo wugaya wudugo. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Lechelelo vanu wolofu wo valongola vakuva kuwudugo, na vanu wo vali kuwudugo vakuva valongola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa vakola katsi va mu mugunda gwa mitsabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Yesu akalongaje, “Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwana na munu munya mugunda yo ilafile hamilawu ili kuvapela vanu katsi ya kulima mu mugunda gwake gwa mitsabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Vakapatanaje kuhombwa mahombo ga siku yimwe, ihyo akavasindikaje ku mugunda gwake gwa mitsabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Akabitaje kaha lisala lya kadatu hamilawu akavafikaje vanu vamwe vimile hono hovagutsilaga finu valihela katsi.” <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Akavalonjelaje, “Henye nanye mubite mukakole katsi ku mugunda gwangu gwa mitsabibu, na heni kuvahomba chochin'ganika.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Yula munya mugunda akahumaje kaha sala sita na sala tisa, akaditaje hihila. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Yavaga kufika sala ya kumi na yimwe mumihe akahumaje kaha, akavafikaje vanu vanji vang'acha vimile valihela katsi. Akavaputsaje, kwasawuli yachi mwimile hono hano munyi yeka bila kukola katsi yoyive? <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Vala vanu vakamujibulaje, twimile hano kwasawuli kuduhu munu yoyuve yo atupelye katsi. Nayo munya mugunda akavalonjelaje, “Henye nanye mubite mukakole katsi ku mugunda gwangu gwa mitsabibu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Hoyavaga kufika hamihe, yula munya mugunda gwa mitsabibu akamulonjelaje mwimilitsi vake va mugunda kuta avacheme vala vakola katsi ili uvahombe mahombo gawo, wantsilaje kwa wo vatsitse hamihe na usinde na vala va hamilawu. <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Vala vakola katsi wo vavisilwe muda gwa sala kumi na yimwe, vakatsaje na chila yumwe akanuchilaje mahombo ga siku yimwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Hambele vakatsaje vala va hamilawu, na hovavaga kufika vahotsaga kuta vakuhombwa kuvalutila vala wo vavisilwe katsi mumihe. Lechelelo chila yumwe akahombwaje mahombo ga siku yimwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Hovavaga kuhombwa, vakantsaje kumukalalila yula munya mugunda” <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Vakamulonjelaje, “Vanu vano wo vavisilwe katsi hamihe vakwete katsi kwa muda gwa lisala limwe hela, na heve uvahombite kota hetwe yo twikangitse na munyi yeka?” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Yula munya mugunda akamujibulaje muyawo yumwe kuta, “Bee, muyangu, singutsulumwe ndaya. Mbe, situkatupatine kuta ngukuhomba mahombo ga siku yimwe? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Tegule mahombo gako ubite. Heni ndamwe kumuhomba munu yuno yo ntsimuvisile katsi hamihe kota fyo nguhombite heve. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Mbe, sindisile kota fyo ntsin'gana kwa mali tsangu? Awu un'wona mbafya kwasawuli mbeye na lusungu?” <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Kahi Yesu akalongaje, “Ho hihyo fyoyikuva, vanu va hawudugo vakuva valongola na valongola vakuva va kuwudugo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga lwa kadatu ndongwa tsa chifo chake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lukasi 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu hoavaga ankwina kubita ku muji gwa Yelusalemu, akabitaje halubali hawiyeka na vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili na kuvalonjela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Muhulikitse, tunkwina kubita ku Yelusalemu, nayo Mwana va Munu vakumubata na kumusindika kwa vavina na vatawula nambiko na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, nawo vakumuhiga akopolwe, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />na kumusindika kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi ili vam'bedale na kumutova mikotya na akukopolwa kwa kuvambwa mu musalaba, lechelelo siku ya kadatu akutsilipuka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuvawo Yakobo na Yohana angumusuka Yesu lulongwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliko 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Kaha yuvawo va vana va Tsebedayo akabitaje kwa Yesu hamwe na vanage, nayo akafugamaje halutalo hake na kuvasuchila vanage lulongwa kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu akamuputsaje, “Un'gana chinu chachi?” Yula mudala akamujibulaje, “Ntsingukugongola undichile kuta iva vanangu, yumwe akikale lubali lwa kwililo na yunji lubali lwa kwichiji ku Wuntsajila wako.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Henye simuchitsele cho munsuka. Mbe, henye mufuluche muching'wele chikombe cha ng'odeko kota chongung'wela heni?” Vakamujibulaje, “Tunvetsa.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ena mufuluche muching'wele chikombe cho ngung'wela heni, lechelelo lulongwa lwa kwikala lubali lwangu lwa kwililo awu lwa kwichiji si katsi yangu kuvapela. Ila vakupelwa vala yovavichilwe chang'ani na Dada vangu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Vala vadahitswa vanji kumi hovavaga kuhulika ihyo, vakavavipilaje iwo vayawo vavili. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Lechelelo Yesu akavachemaje na kuvalonjela, “Muntsela kuta vantsajila va vanu wosi Vayawudi, vavatavalaga vanu kwa ludali, nawo vavina valajilaga mamulaka gawo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Henye mulekaje kudita ihyo, lechelelo munu yo an'gana kuva muvina kwa henye, an'ganika ave mutantsi venyu. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Nayo munu yoan'gana kuva mulongola hagati henyu ing'anika ave mutantsi venyu, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />kota hila Mwana va Munu siatsitse ili atumichilwe, lechelelo atsitse kutumichila na kuwutawula wumi wake ili kuvagombola vanu vanji.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu vavili wo vabofwe.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lukasi 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake hovavaga van'wuka ku muji gwa Yeliko, vanu wolofu wakamufwataje. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Fibofu vavili vavaga vichite halubali lwa ng'asi, na hovavaga kuhulika kuta Yesu anlutila hono iho, vakakolaje kuta, “Mutwa Mwana va Dawudi utuwonele lusungu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Lila lilugu lya vanu likavang'anulilaje na kuvalonjela mukatuche, lechelelo vene vakalutitsaje kulonga fikami, “Mutwa Mwana va Dawudi utuwonele lusungu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu akimaje na kuvachema, akavaputsaje, “Mun'gana ntsivaditile chinu chachi?” <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Vala fibofu vakamujibulaje, “Mutwa tun'gana kulola!” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu akavawonelaje lusungu na kuvadometsa miho gawo, na luvala lulo vakalolaje na kumufwata.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ankwinjila ku muji gwa Yelusalemu kuno antovelwa ngulugulu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lukasi 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake hovavaga kufika ku Besifwaje kuchidunda cha Mitseyituni habehi na muji gwa Yelusalemu, Yesu akavatumaje vadahitswa vake vavili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />na kuvalonjela kuta, “Mubite ku chijiji cho chili kulutalo, mukuyifika ntsove yiwopitwe hamwe na ntsanage. Mutsiwopole mundetele. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Manyi munu yoyuve avaputse lulongwa lo luve, Manyi munu yoyuve avaputse lulongwa lulove, mumulonjele kuta, Mutwa angutsigana,” Nayo bahobaho akuvaleka. <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Lulongwa ulu lukadisilwe ili tsikwile ndongwa tso alialontsile muloli va Mulungu kuta.<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Muvalonjele vanu va muji gwa Sayuni, ulole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Muntsajila vako ankutsa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Mudeche na ankutsa akwinile ntsove, tsana ya ntsove.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ihyo vala vadahitswa vakaditaje kota fyoavaga avalajitse. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Vakamuletelaje Yesu yila ntsove na ntsanage, vakavikaje myenda jawo mwilanga mwa ntsana ya ntsove na Yesu akakwinaje mwilanga mwa ntsana ntsove. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Vanu wolofu vakatandikaje myenda jawo mung'asi na vanji vakafibenaje fiputi fya mibichi na kufitandatsa mu ng'asi. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Vanu vanji wolofu wovavaga kutalo na vanji wovavaga kumbele. Veka vakatovaje chiyove na kumulumba Mulungu kwa kulonga kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">“Atsumitswe Mwana va Dawudi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Atambichilwe na Mulungu mwene yo ankutsa kwa litawa lya Mutwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Ntsumitso kwa Mulungu yo ali Kilanga!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu fyo avaga ankwinjila ku muji gwa Yelusalemu na vanu veka va muji gula vakitinaje na kiputsa kuta, “Uyuno yo nani?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Vala vanu wolofu vakalongaje, “Uyo yo Yesu muloli yo ahumye kwa Mulungu, vakuhuma ku muji gwa Natsaleti, inyi ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu am'bita ku Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lukasi 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu hoavaga kufika ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, akavavingaje vanu wo vavaga van'gula na kugutsa finu ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, akabidulangaje metsa tsa vanu wo vavaga vamfuntsa magobole. Kaha akabidulangaje figoda fya vala wo vavaga van'gutsa ng'unda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Akavalonjelaje yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, “Nyumba Yangu yikuchemwa Nyumba ya kusalila. Lechelelo henye muyidisile yive malika ya vawumiyani.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Vanu wovali fibofu na fiteve vakabitaje kwa Yesu iho ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, nayo akavaponetsaje. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Lechelelo vavina va vatawula nambiko hamwe na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakavipaje hovavaga kuwona ndongwa tsa ndajilo jo adisile Yesu, na kuvahulika vana fyo vankwimba ha Nyumba ya Mulungu kuta, “Ntsumitso tsive kwa Mwana va Dawudi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ihyo vakamulonjelaje, “Mbe, sinambe uhuliche vana fyo vankwimba?” Yesu akavajibulaje, “Ee Ntsinhulika, mbe simukasomile mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">Kwa milomo ja vana vadodo na fyali fyo finkong'a vangukutsumitsa heve?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Kahi Yesu akawukaje na kuhuma kivala kwa muji, na akabitaje ku muji gwa Besaniya na kuvasa kuko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukotola mubichi gogulihela mibawo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliko 11:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Kung'acha hamilawu, Yesu hoavaga mung'asi kuwuya ku Yelusalemu kuhuma ku muji gwa Besaniya, akawonaje tsala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Akaguwonaje mubichi gwa mutsombe go gwavaga halubali ha ng'asi, lechelelo gwavaga gulihela mibawo ila mihamba ng'ani. Akagukotolaje kwakulonga kuta, “Ulekaje kulela mibawo ng'o!” Luvala lulo gula mutsombe gukakalaje. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Vadahitswa vake ho vavaga kuluwona lulongwa ulo vakapomokaje na kulonga, “Yiveye ndawuli mubichi guno gunkala luvala lulu hela?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, Manyi muve na litumbilo na manyi muve mulihela muhwehwe goguve, si mukudita ndongwa itsi ng'ani tso ndisile, lechelelo henye mukuvetsa kuchilonjela chidunda chino, chigumuche na chibite kitotse ku bahali, navho chikudita hihyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Manyi muve na litumbilo, chinu chochive cho mukumusuka Mulungu mu suko, mukupelwa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amputswa ndongwa tsa wuvetso wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lukasi 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu ho avaga kuwuya kaha ha Nyumba ya Mulungu na kwantsa kudahitsa. Vavina va vatawula nambiko na vavina va Vayawudi vakamuputsaje, “Un'dita ndongwa tsino kwa wuwetso wa nani? Alikwiya yo akupelye wuwetso wuno?” <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Na heni nguvaputsa chinu chimwe. Manyi munjibule na heni nguvajibula ntsin'dita ndongwa tsino kwa wuvetso wa nani. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Mbe, wubatitso wa Yohana wahumye kwa nani, mbe, wahumye Kilanga kwa Mulungu awu kwa vanu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Lechelelo vakantsaje kiputsa vene kwa vene na kulonga, “Manyi tulonje wahumye kwa Mulungu akutuputsa, mbona simwa mutumbye Yohana? <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Lechelelo manyi tulonje, wuhumye kwa vanu, Tunguwogopa vanu vano chila cho vafuluche vatudite, kwasawuli veka vangumutsela Yohana kuta avaga muloli va Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Ihyo vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Hetwe sinambe tutsele.” Nayo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Heni singuvalonjela ntsin'dita ndongwa tsino kwa mamulaka ga nani.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munhwano gwa vakwamitsi vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Lechelelo munhotsa ndawuli? Kwavaga na munu yumwe avaga na vana vavili. Akabitaje kwa yula va kwantsa na kumulonjela, abite kumukolela katsi kumugunda gwa mitsabibu. <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yula mwana akamujibulaje dade, heni singubita Lechelelo hambele akagalutsaje mahotso gake, akabitaje kukola katsi. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Kaha yula dada akamulonjelaje mwana va kavili, nayo akalongaje, akamudichilaje dade, Lechelelo si akahele kukola katsi. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Mbe, nani hagati ha iwo vavili yo akwitsitse cho aganaga dadawo?” Vakamujibulaje, “Yula mulongola.” Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, vakongotsa kodi hamwe na vanu vanya mbwiniyo tsa waafu vakuvalongola henye kwinjila ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Kwasawuli Yohana Mubatitsi akatsitse kwenyu kuvalajila hila fyo mun'ganika kudita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, lechelelo henye simwamuhulikitse, lechelelo vakongotsa kodi hamwe na vanya miho matali vakamuhulikitse. Lechelelo henye namuvaje mwatsiwene ndongwa tso aditaga ino henye simwihatsile na kuleka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi na kaha simwa mutumbye.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa valimi va mugunda gwa mitsabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lukasi 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muhulikitse muhwano gunji. Munu yumwe avaga alimile mugunda gwa mitsabibu na kutsenga lwigo, na akayavaje hono ha kukamila tsabibu, na akatsengaje na hono hachanya ho akwima ili amile mugunda gwake. Kaha akavakodetsaje valimi lechelelo mwene akabitaje ku inyi ya kutali. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Chipindi cha kubeta ho chavaga kuva habehi, akavatumaje vatantsi vake kwa vala valimi ili vakamutegulile cho an'ganika kupelwa mu mbeto tsila. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Vala valimi vakavabataje kwa lilakali vatantsi vala, yumwe vakamutovaje na yumwe vakamukopolaje na yunji vakamutovaje na maganga. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Yula munu akavatumaje vatantsi vanji wolofu kulutila vala valongola. Vala valimi vakavaditilaje kota fyo vavaditye valongola. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Ihyo hawudugo wake akamutumaje mwanage kuno anhotsa kuta, manyi vakumwidichila mwanangu. <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Lechelelo valimi vala hovavaga kumuwona mwanage vakalonganaje vene kwa vene kuta, uyuno yo muhali, lelo tumukopole ili tutegule wuhalo wake! <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ihyo vakamubataje kwa lilakali na kumuhumya kivala kwa mugunda gwa mitsabibu, vakamukopolaje.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Henye fyo munhotsa yula munya mugunda ho akuva kutsa akuvadita chinu chachi valimi iwo?” <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Vala vanu vakamulonjelaje kuta, akuvananga valimi iwo na mugunda gula akuvakodetsela valimi vanji wo vakumupela mbeto hovakuva mwanga vabesile.<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Iho Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mbe! Simwasomile lulongwa luno mu Maandiko ga Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Liganga lya kutsenjela lyo valilemile vatsentsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">sambi liveye liganga likomi linofu kulutila geka lyo lin'ganika kwa wutsentsi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Mutwa yo adisile lulongwa luno, nalo luveye lwa kutupomotsa hetwe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Ihyo ntsinguvalonjela, Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wukuhetswa kwenyu na vakupelwa vanu vanji wosi Vayawudi wo vakudita kota hila fyo an'gana Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Munu yoyuve yo akugwa mu liganga ilyo akubeneka fipande fipande, na wone limugwile munu yoyuve likumutijina fipande fipande. <verse eid="MAT 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Vavina va Vatawula nambiko hamwe na Vafwalisayo ho vavaga kuhulika mihwano ijo, vakatselaje kuta anguvalonga vene. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Lelo vakantsaje kusaka kuta vakumubata chinya ndawuli, lechelelo vawogopaga vanu. Kwasawuli vanu vatselaga kuta Yesu yo muloli va Mulungu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano wa chilyo cha litsenjele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Lukasi 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu akalongaje nawo kaha kwa mihwano. <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwana na muntsajila yo amuvichye chang'ani mwanage chilyo cha litsenjele. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Akavatumaje vatantsi vake vakavalibulitse vanu mu liwungo, lechelelo vala wo valibulitswe vakalemaje. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Kaha akavatumaje vatantsi vanji, na kuvalonjela kuta muvalonjele vala wo valibulitswe kuta, mutse mulitsenjele lyangu lilichang'ani kwasawuli ya henye, mwanga sintsitse senga tsangu ng'ambaku na tsinji tsotsinonile na chila chinu chili chang'ani, ihyo mutse mwitsenjele. <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Lechelelo vene vakabedalaje lulongwa ulo, na chila munu akabitaje ku lulongwa lwake, yumwe akabitaje kumugunda gwake, na yunji ku katsi tsake, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />na vamwe vakavabataje vala vatantsi vake kwa lilakali, vakavatovaje na kuvakopola. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Duve yula muntsajila akavipaje ndalahela, ihyo akavatumaje vatova ligalu vake vakavakopole vala wo vavakopwe vatantsi vake na kugunyanya moto muji gwawo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Hambele akavalonjelaje vatantsi vake kuta, liwungo lya litsenjele lili chang'ani, lechelelo vala wo tuvalibulitse sivaganikije kutsa ndaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Ino lelo mubite mu mitava ja vanu wolofu mukamulibulitse chila munu yo yuve yo mu kumuwona atse mulitsenjele, <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Vala vatantsi vakabitaje mu mitava ja vanu wolofu vakavakong'asaje vanu veka wo vavawene, vawuya na vabi. Hala ha lidama ho lyakolekaga litsenjele hakamemaje vajentsi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Lechelelo muntsajila ho avaga kwinjila mugati ili avawone vajentsi, akamuwonaje munu yumwe yo avaga sialafwala mwenda gwa litsenjele lila. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Muntsajila akamuputsaje, muyangu, winje muno chinyandawuli na kuno siufwite mwenda gwa litsenjele lino? Lechelelo mwene akagayaje cha kulonga. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Iho yula muntsajila akavalonjelaje vatantsi vake, ale mumuwope mawoko na magulu mukamutotse kivala ko kuna jitsa. Uko ko kukuva na chivembo na kugwegwetsula mino.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu akasindikitsaje kwa kulonga kuta, “Kwasawuli wo vachemilwe wolofu, lechelelo wo vahagulwe vadodo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbutso tsa kutawula kodi kwa Kayisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lukasi 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Ihyo vala Vafwalisayo vakawukaje hono hala ho avaga Yesu, na vakabitaje kulongana hila fyo vakumudaditsa Yesu kwa ndongwa tsake. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Vakavatumaje vatantsi vawo hamwe na Vahelode, vakamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Mudahitsi tun'tsela kuta heve uli munu yo an'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu na un'dahitsa ndongwa tsa Mulungu kwa wugolofu, siumogopaga munu yoyuve, na kaha siumukakamilaga munu yoyuve munya chewo. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Ino utulonjele chinu cho un'hotsa heve, Mbe, hetwe tun'ganika awu sinambe tuganiche kuhomba kodi kwa muntsajila va Loma?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Lechelelo Yesu akatselaje wubi wawo, akavalonjelaje, “Henye vapunganitsi mbona munsaka kundaditsa? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Mundajile ligobole ilyo lyo muhombaga kodi.” Nawo vakamuletelaje lindolosi! <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Lelo Yesu akavaputsaje, “Sula iyi na litawa ili fya nani?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Vakamujibulaje, “Muntsajila va inyi ya Loma?” Iho Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Finu fya muntsajila muvina va Loma mumupele muntsajila va Loma, na finu fya Mulungu mumupele Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Hovavaga kuhulika ihyo vakapomokaje, vakamulekaje na kuwuka.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vasadukayo vangumuwutsa Yesu ndongwa tsa kutsilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lukasi 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Siku yiyo Vasadukayo vamwe wo valongaga kuta kuduhu wutsilipuko wa vanu, vakabitaje kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Vakamulonjelaje kuta, “Mudahitsi, Musa avaga atulonje kuta munu yo atweye mudala manyi afwe bila kuva na mwana, yin'ganika mung'olotse amuhale mufwile uyo, ili amulelele vana mung'olotse yo afweye. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Lelo iha hetu havaga na vanu saba va lukolo lumwe. Mulongola akatolaje mudala, hambele yula akafwaje kuno alihela vana, ihyo mung'olotse yunji akamuhalaje mufwile yula. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Lulongwa ulo lukavaje hihyo kwa yula va kavili, na va kadatu, na mbaka veka vala saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ho vavaga kufwa veka, hambele na mudala yula nayo akafwaje. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Lelo siku yila ya wutsilipuko uyo mudala akuva mchina va nani kwa vala valume saba? Kwasawuli veka vavaga vamutweye.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vala Vasadukayo kuta, “Henye mun'yaga kwasawuli sinambe mugatsele Mandiko ga Mulungu wala wuvetso wake. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kwasawuli vanu wo vafweye ho vakutsilipuka sivakutola awu kutoleka, kwasawuli vakuva kota vatantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ino lelo kwa ndongwa tsa wutsilipuko, mbe, simukasomile hila fyo avaga alontsile Mulungu? Hila fyo avalonje kuta, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />Heni yo Mulungu va Ibulamu, na Yisaka, na Yakobo! Ihyo mwene siyo Mulungu va vanu wo vafweye, mwene yo Mulungu va vanu wo vali wumi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Vala vanu wolofu hovavaga kuhulika lulongwa ulo, vakapomokaje kwa madahitso gake.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndajitso ngomi kulutila tseka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lukasi 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Vafwalisayo hovavaga kuhulika kuta Yesu avakatukitse Vasadukayo, vakakong'anaje hamwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Yumwe va mudahitsi va malajitso ga Musa akamuputsaje Yesu kwa kumujela, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Mudahitsi, ndajitso yachi yo ngomi mu malajitso?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu akamujibulaje kuta “Umugane Mutwa Mulungu vako kwa numbula yako yeka, na kwa muhe gwako gweka, na kwa luhala lwako lweka. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Iyi yo ndajitso ngomi na yo ndajitso ndongola. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ndajitso ya kavili yinhwana na yiyo kuta umugane munu va habehi kota fyo ungwigana heve. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Malajitso geka ga Musa na madahitso geka ga valoli va Mulungu, gahumye mu malajitso iga gavili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaputsa Vafwalisayo kuta Chilisito Muhagulwa yo nani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lukasi 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Vafwalisayo ho vavaga vang'acha vakong'ine bahalaga, Yesu akavaputsaje kuta, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Henye munguluhotsa ndawuli lulongwa lwa Chilisito Muhagulwa? Mbe, mwana va nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Vakamujibulaje kuta, “Mwana va Dawudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Lelo yiveye ndawuli Dawudi kwa kulongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu angumuchema mwene Mutwa? Kwasawuli alontsile hino,”<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Mutwa akamulonjelaje Mutwa vangu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">wikale lubali lwa liwoko lyangu lililo mbaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">ntsivaviche vatelani vako hasi ha magulu gako.”<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />“Lelo manyi Dawudi angumuchema Chilisito, Mutwa, yikuva ndawuli ave mwanage?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Kuduhuli munu yo yuve yo awoniche kumujibula chinu. Luhuma siku iyo kuduhuli munu yo ajetsitse kumuputsa chinu.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvang'anulila vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Vafwalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38">Maliko 12:38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Lukasi 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake hamwe na vanu vala wolofu kuta, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Vafwalisayo wo vanago mamulaka ga kudadambula malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Ihyo mun'ganika kibata na kudita chila cho vakuvalonjela, lechelelo mwalahogola kwiga fyo van'dita, kwasawuli sivaditaga chila cho vanguvavikulila. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Vawopaga mijamanda na kuvatwika vanu mu mayega, lechelelo vene valemaga kuvatanga nambe kitwika hela. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Vene vaditaga ndongwa tsawo itso kwasawuli ya kuwoneka kwa vanu. Vafwalaga fisipi fya nyingo mumawoko gawo na mufihanga fyawo fyo fyandikwe Mandiko ga malajitso ga Musa, na kufwala myenda jinya fifundo finya filebeto fitali. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Kaha vaganaga kikalisa mu mawungo mu figoda fya kutalo fya vanu vatambulwa, na mu nyumba tsa kwitang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Vaganaga kusamuswa na vanu kwa kukakamilwa hono ha kugutsila finu, na kugana kuchemwa, vadahitsi. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Lechelelo henye mulekaje kuchemwa kuta vadahitsi! Kwasawuli mudahitsi venu yumwe hela, na henye nyeka muli lukolo. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Kaha mulekaje kumuchema munu yoyuve kuta dada mu inyi, kwasawuli Dada venyu yo yumwe hela, yo ali Kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Mulekaje kuchemwa, filongotsi! Kwasawuli chilongotsi venyu yo yumwe hela nayo yo Chilisito. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Munu yo akuva muvina hagati henyu uyo yo an'ganika ave mutantsi venyu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Munu yo angidutsa akwiswa, nayo yo angiyisa akukwinitswa.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvang'anulila vanu vapunganitsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Lukasi 11:39-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">Lukasi 20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Mukudutsa henye vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Vafwalisayo vapunganitsi! Kwasawuli mun'dinda lwitsi lwa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu halutalo ha miho ga vanu. Henye vene sinambe mwinjile mugati, na kaha nambe muvaleche wo van'gana kwinjila vinjile. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Mukudutsa henye vadahitsi va malajitso na Vafwalisayo vapunganitsi! Yo muntegula finu fya vafwile na kilajila kuta muli vanu vawuya na kusala suko nali. Ihyo kwa lulongwa ulo mukuhigwa wuhigo wukomi ndalahela!<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Mukudutsa henye vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Vafwalisayo vapunganitsi! Henye yo mun'jnda ku bahali na ku inyi ng'afu ili mumudite munu yumwe agaluche na kuvafwata henye. Lechelelo manyi mumupate, mumuditaga ave mwana va ku Jehanamu ndalahela kuvalutila henye.”<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Mukudutsa henye filongotsi fibofu! Henye yo munlonga kuta, manyi munu ilahe kwa Nyumba ya Mulungu, wilaho uwo si chinu ndaya, Lechelelo manyi munu ilahe kwa tsahabu yo yitawulwe mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, wulaho uwo wukumubata. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Henye fibofu muvapufi! Chinu chachi cho china mana kulutila chinji, yila tsahabu awu yila Nyumba ya Mulungu yo yinguyidita tsahabu iyo yive nyagulwa na Mulungu? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Lechelelo kaha mulongaga kuta, manyi munu ilahe kwa hono ha kutawulila nambiko, wulaho uwo siwuli chinu ndaya. Lechelelo manyi munu ilahe kwa nambiko yo yili hono ha kutawulila nambiko, wilaho uwo wukumubata. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Henye fibofu! Chinu chachi cho china mana ndalahela, yila nambiko awu hala hono ha kutawulila nambiko ho hanguyidita yila nambiko yive nyagulwa na Mulungu? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ho ihyo lelo manyi munu ilahe kwa iho hono ha kutawulila nambiko, ilahaga kwa hono iho ha kutawulila nambiko na kwa finu fyeka fyo fili mwilanga mwake. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Nayo munu yo akilaha kwa Nyumba ya Mulungu, angilaha kwa iyo Nyumba ya Mulungu na kwa uyo Mulungu yo angikala mugati. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Nayo yo akilaha kwa Kilanga kwa Mulungu, akuva angilaha kwa chigoda cha Wuntsajila cha Mulungu na kwa mwene yo angikala mu chigoda icho.”<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Mukudutsa henye vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Vafwalisayo vapunganitsi! Kwasawuli muntawula chimwe mu finu kumi hata kwa nyadikwa tsa mboga, na bintsali na wufuta, lechelelo mulema kudita ndongwa tso angutsigana Mulungu, kota hila kudita wuwuya kwa Mulungu, na kuva na lusungu na kuva vanu vakihuvilwa kwa Mulungu na kwa vanu. Mun'ganika kugadita geka makomi na madodo, na mulekaje kusemwa na gala ganji. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Henye filongotsi fibofu! Mun'jlula finu fidodo kota ntsuguni mu malenga, lechelelo mummila finu fikomi kota linyama lyo linchemwa ngamiya!”<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Mukudutsa henye vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Vafwalisayo henye muva punganitsi! Kwasawuli munhofuga fikombe na bakuli mwivala, lechelelo munleka mugati mumemile finu fyo muvasukwe vanu kota fyo mun'gana henye. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Henye Vafwalisayo fibofu! Muhofugaje chikombe mugati tandi na kivala nako ho chikuva chelu.”<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Mukudutsa henye vadahitsiva malajitso ya Musa vapunganitsi, Munakota makabuli go gabasilwe chokaha kwa kivala go gan'woneka kuta manofu, lechelelo mugati fimemile fitseje na kuwola. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Hihila na henye kwa kivala mun'woneka na chila vanu kuta mun'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, lechelelo kwa mugati mumemile wupunganitsi na ndongwa ntsibi.”<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvalonjela hila fyo vakuhigwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Lukasi 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Mukudutsa henye vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Mafwaliyo vapunganitsi! Mun'tsenga makabuli ga valoli va Mulungu, na kuganotsa makabuli ga vanu wo van'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Na henye munlonga kuta, manyi hetwe tuka twikale luvala lula vakukwetu ho vavaga wumi, si tukakihantsa nawo kwa kuvakopola valoli va Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ihyo munlajila kuta henye yo muli vana va vanu vala wo vavakopwe valoli va Mulungu! <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Lelo mukwitsaje ndongwa ntsibi tsa vakukwenyu. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Henye yo munakota ntsoka, na lulelo lwa ntsoka tso tsina sumu! Mukukuluka chinya ndawuli wuhigo wa moto gwa Jehanamu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Kwasawuli yino heni ntsinguvaletela valoli va Mulungu na vanya ntselo, na vadahitsi. Vamwe mukuvakopola na kuvavamba mu musalaba, na vamwe mukuvatova kwa mikotya mu nyumba tsenyu tsa kitang'anila na mukuvasaka chijiji kwa chijiji kovali. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ihyo yila ng'otolo yo yambutswe na vakukwenyu yo vavakopwe vala wo vaditaga kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, kuhuma kukopolwa kwa Abeli yo avaga alihela nongwa yoyive, mbaka kukopolwa kwa Tsekaliya mwana va Belachiya, yo vamukopwe hagati ha Nyumba ya Mulungu na hono ha kutawulila nambiko. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, ndongwa itso tseka tsikuhigwa mu chilelo chino.”<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu fyo aguvembye muji gwa Yelusamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34">Lukasi 13:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Yelusalemu! Bee, Yelusalemu! Munguvakopola valoli va Mulungu na kuvatova na maganga vala wo vatumilwe kwako. Kalinga ntsiwiniwe kuvakong'asa vanago kota hila ng'uku fyo yikong'asaga fitswiya fyake mumabava gake, lechelelo ukalemile. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Lelo nyumba yako yikulekwa mahame. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Ntsingukulonjela kuta, si mukumbona kaha mbaka hala ho ukulonga kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 23:39">Aditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu mwene yo ankutsa kwa litawa lya Mutwa.”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga ndongwa tsa kubomolwa kwa Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Maliko 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Lukasi 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu akahumaje na kuwuka mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, ho avaga an'wuka, vadahitswa vake vakabitaje na kwantsa kulongana nayo ndongwa tsa nyumba tsinji tso tsipilime mulubali fyo tsitsentsilwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Mbe, mungugawona iga geka? Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, kuduhu nambe liganga limwe lyo likusigala hano mwilanga mwa liganga linji, geka gano gakubomolwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitango cha siku tsa wudugo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lukasi 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu hoavaga ichite ha chidunda cha mitseyituni, vadahitswa vake vakamutsilaje hono iho kwa wufiho na kumuputsa, “Utulonjele ndongwa itso tsikuhumila hanili, na ndajilo yachi yo yikulajila kutsa kwako na ndajilo ya wudugo wa inyi?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Mwiyangalilaje, munu alekaje kuvayatsa. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kwasawuli vanu wolofu vakutsa kwa Litawa lyangu na kulonga kuta, heni yo Chilisito, nawo vakuvadeteletsa vanu wolofu. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Mukuhulika ndongwa magalu, na mwepweletsi tsa ligalu, lechelelo mulekaje kutinuswa, kwasawuli ndongwa itso tseka tsin'ganika tsihumile, lechelelo wula wudugo wung'ali. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Vanu va inyi yimwe vakwitova na vanu va inyi yinji, na vanu va wuntsajila wumwe wukwitova na vanu va wuntsajila wunji. Kukuva na ntsala na mikakamo ja inyi chila hono. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ifyo fyeka fikuva kota wulongolo wa wusungu wa kulela mwana.”<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Kaha vakuvabata na kuvakoda, na vamwe vakukopolwa. Mukuvipilwa na inyi tseka kwasawuli henye munumbila heni. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Luvala ulo vanu wolofu wo van'numba vakundeka kunumba, vakipituka na kivipila. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Vakuhumila valoli wolofu va wudesi na vakuvayatsa vanu wolofu. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kwasawuli ya kulutila kwa ndongwa ntsibi, wugano wa vanu wolofu wukupunguka. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Lechelelo munu yoyuve yo akwikangatsa mbaka ha wudugo uyo yo akukuluka. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Lechelelo wudugo howukuva wung'ali kufika, Ndongwa Nofu tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu tsikuvikulwa ku inyi tseka, ili vanu veka vahuliche.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siku tsa ng'odeko ngomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lukasi 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Ihyo ho mukuwona, chinu chibi cho chinleta wananjifu cho alontsile Danyeli muloli va Mulungu chivisilwe ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, yo ansoma an'ganika atsele, <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />iho vanu veka wo vali ku inyi ya Yudeya vachimbililaje kufidunda. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Munu yoyuve yo ali mwilanga kwa nyumba alekaje kwika ili ategule chinu chochive cho chili mu nyumba yake. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Munu yoyuve yo ali kumugunda alekaje kuwuya kukaye kutegula mwenda gwake. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Vakukodeka ndalahela vadala vanya wubofu na wo vankosa fyali siku itso. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Mumusukaje Mulungu ili kubilima kwenyu kulekaje kuva siku tsa chisisima awu ha Siku ya Weselo. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kwasawuli luvala ulo kukuva na ng'odeko ngomi yo siyavaga yiwoniche kuhuma ha wulongolo wa inyi mbaka sambi, na kaha si yalatsa yihumile kaha. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Manyi siku itso tsika sitsilapungutswa kuduhu munu yoyuve yo akakukuluka ave mumi. Lechelelo Mulungu atsipungutse siku itso kwasawuli ya vala vanu vake vahagulwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Ino lelo manyi munu avalonjele kuta, Chilisito ali hano awu Ali kula, Mulekaje kumutumba. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kwasawuli vakuhumila valoli va wudesi na vanu wo vakulonga kuta vene yo machilisito. Vakudita ndajilo ngomi na ndajilo myolofu ili kuvayatsa nambe vala vahagulwa va Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mwiyangalile henye, heni mwanga ndongwe kuvalonjela luvala luno mwanga ndongwa itso tsing'acha kuhumila. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Kwasawuli iyo manyi munu yoyuve avalonjele kuta, mulave Chilisito ali kula ku mbuga, mulekaje kubita, awu kuta, ali mu nyumba, mulekaje kumutumba. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Kwasawuli kota hila lwenje lwa liladu fyo lwangatsaga kuhuma lubali lwa kuwuhumilo wa litsuva na kuwoneka mbaka kuwusotelo lya litsuva, ho hihyo fyo yikuva kutsa kwake Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Kwasawuli hala ho lifwilye linyama, ho baho ho jikong'anaga migungule.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa kwa Mwana va Munu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lukasi 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Hala ho tsikuva tsilutye ng'odeko tsa siku tsila, litsuva likugubikwa na jitsa, nago mwetsi si gukuvala, natso nyenyetsi tsikugwa kuhuma kilanga, na ngufu tsa ku lulanga tsikutigasika. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Iho ho yikuhumila ndajilo ya Mwana va Munu yikuwoneka kululanga na kabila tseka tsikulomboketsa. Nawo vakumuwona Mwana va Munu ankutsa mwilanga mwa mafuluka munya mamulaka na wumelemo wukomi. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Litsi likomi lya litalumbeta likuhulikwa, nayo akuvatuma vatantsi vake va Kilanga ili vavakong'ase vahagulwa vake kuhuma mbali tseka tsitayi tsa inyi, kuhuma wudugo wumwe wa kilanga mbaka wudugo wunji wa kilanga.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mubichi go gunchemwa mutini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lukasi 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Mwidahitsaje muhwano guno kukolela kwa mubichi gwa mutini. Manyi muguwone miputi jake jantsitse kuva mideche na mahamba kudedemula, mun'tsela kuta ndonya yilihabehi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ho hihyo manyi mutsiwone ndongwa itso tsinhumila mutselaje kuta mwana va munu alihabehi ndalahela. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, chilelo chino sichikulutila mbaka ndongwa itso tseka tsihumile. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Kilanga na inyi fikulutila, lechelelo ndongwa tsa heni sitsikulutila ndaya.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu munu yo antsela siku awu sala ya kuwuya Mwana va Munu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maliko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Lukasi 17:26-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Lechelelo kwa ndongwa tsa siku iyo awu sala iyo, kuhudu munu yo antsela, nambe vatantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu, nambe Mwana va Munu, ila Dada aliyeka. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kota fyo yavaga chipindi cha Nuhu, hihyo fyo kukuva kutsa kwake Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Luvala lula hoyavaga ying'ali kuhumila yila ng'uka ngomi, vanu vavaga vankulya na kung'wa, vatolaga na kutoleka, mbaka siku yila Nuwu avaga kwinjila mugati mwa litumbwi likomi lyo linchemwa Safina, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />vanu sivatselaga chinu chochive cho chikuhumila, na ndonya ngomi yikatonyaje kwa siku ntsolofu na vanu vakafwaje kwa lulenga. Ihyo fyo yikuva ho akutsa Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Luvala ulo vanu vavili vakuva kumugunda, yumwe akutegulwa na yunji akulekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Vadala vavili vakuva vanhalula wuhemba hamwe, yumwe akutegulwa na yumwe akulekwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Ino lelo mwilangalilaje, kwasawuli simuyitsele siku yo akutsa Mutwa venyu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Lechelelo mutselaje lulongwa luno kuta, manyi munya nyumba aka atsele kuta luvala lwachi lo akutsa muhitsi akakikala miho, na si akakuyileka nyumba yake yigumulwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ihyo lelo na henye nanye mun'ganika mwivikaje chang'ani, kwasawuli Mwana va Munu akutsa sala yo sinambe muyitsele.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutantsi muwuya na yula yo simuwuya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Lukasi 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesu akawilaje kulonga kuta, “Nani yo mutantsi muwuya na munya luhala yo muntsajila vake akumuvika avimilile vanu vake na kuvapela filyo kwa muda go gun'ganika? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Akuhechelela mutantsi yula, manyi mutwa vake ho akuva kutsa akumufika an'dita ihyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, akumuvika mutantsi uyo ave mwimilitsi wa finu fyake yeka. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Lechelelo manyi mutantsi uyo ave siyo muwuya, na manyi ilonjele munumbula yake kuta, Mutwa vangu akuchelewa kuwuya, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />na antse kuvatova vatantsi vayage na kulya na kung'wa hamwe na vagatsi, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />muvina vake akutsa siku yo sinambe ayitsele mutantsi uyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Uyo muvina vake akumutova ndalahela na kumuvika hamwe na vanu wo sinambe vamuhulikitse, hono ho hakuva na chivembo na kugwegwetsula mino.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa vahintsa kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Yesu akalongaje, “Luvala ulo Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wukihwana na vahintsa kumi wo vategwe tala tsawo na kubita kumutang'anitsa mukosano. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Vahanu vavaga vapufi na vahanu vanji vavaga na nyala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Vala vapufi vakategulaje koloboyi tsawo, lechelelo vakalekaje kutegula na mafuta ga hachiba. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Lechelelo vala vanya nyala vakategulaje koloboyi tsawo hamwe na mafuta ga hachiba mu supa tsawo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Yula mukosano hoavaga kuchelewa kutsa, vala vahintsa veka vakasintsilaje na kuvasa tulo. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Hachilo na gati kukavaje na chiyove, Alee henyee! Mukosano ankutsa, mubite mukamutang'anitse. <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Iho vala vahintsa veka vakalamukaje, vakatsiwuyapaje koloboyi tsawo ili tsache finofu. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Ihyo vala vahintsa wo vagaya nyala vakavalonjelaje vala vanya nyala kuta, mutupele chidogo mafuta genyu kwasawuli koloboyi tsetu tsin'tsima. <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Lechelelo vala vanya nyala vakavalonjelaje, ndaya sigakutukwila hetwe na henye! Chiba mubite kwa wo van'gutsa mukagule mafuta genyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ino lelo vala vahintsa wo vagaya nyala hovavaga kubita kugula mafuta, mukasano akafikaje, na vala vahintsa wo valichang'ani vakinjilaje mu nyumba yila ya litsenjele hamwe na mukasano na lwitsi lukadindwaje. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Hambele vala vahintsa vanji vapufi vakatsaje na kwantsa kuchema fikami, Muvina! Muvina! Utudindulile! <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Lechelelo yula mukosano akavajibulaje tsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, sintsivatsele henye.” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Kaha Yesu akasindaje kwa kulonga, “Mwiyangalilaje, kwasawuli simuyitsele siku wala sala.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa vatantsi vadatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Lukasi 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Kaha Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wukihwana na munu yumwe yo an'gana kubita kulujendo, akavachemaje vatantsi vake na kuvisa kwawo mali tsake tseka. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Yumwe akagavilwaje fifuko fihanu fya tsahabu, na yunji fifuko fivili na yunji kafuko kamwe, chila yumwe akagavilwaje kota wuvetso wake fyo wuli. Hambele mwene akawukaje. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Yula yo agavilwe fifuko fihanu fya tsahabu akabitaje na kuditila biyasala, akapataje fifuko finji fihanu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Hihila na vakavili akagavilwaje fifuko fivili fya tsahabu, akapataje fifuko finji fivili. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Lechelelo yula yo agavilwe chifuko chimwe cha tsahabu, akabitaje kuyava lyowo na kuchitila, akachifihaje chifuko chila cha muvina vake.”<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Hotsavaga kulutila siku ntsolofu yula muvina va vatantsi vala akawuyaje, ili atsele mali tsake fyotsili. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Yule mutantsi yo agavilwe fifuko fihanu fya tsahabu, akatsaje na fifuko finji fihanu. Akalongaje kuta, Muvina, wavaga umelye fifuko fihanu fya tsahabu, ihano tsinafyo fifuko finji fihanu. <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Muvina vake akamulonjelaje, Heve mutantsi muwuya na vakihuvilwa! Udisile finofu kwa lulongwa ludodo, lelo ngukuvika mu ndongwa ngomi. Utse usangale hamwe na heni muvina vako.”<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Yula yo agavilwe fifuko fivili fya tsahabu, akaletaje fifuko finji fivili. Akalongaje kuta, Muvina, heni ukamelye fifuko fivili fya tsahabu, lave masile fifuko finji fivili. <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Muvina vake akamulonjelaje, Heve mutantsi muwuya na vakihuvila. Udisile finofu kwa lulongwa ludodo, ngukuvika mu ndongwa ngomi. Utse wusangale hamwe na muvina vako.”<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Lechelelo yula yo apelitwe kafuko kamwe ka tsahabu nayo akatsaje na kulonga kuta, Muvina, heni ntselije kuta heve uli munu mukangafu, na ubetaga hala ho siuyalite, na ulundaga hala ho siulatagalitsa. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Lelo ngavaje na muloto, ngakatilaje hasi kafuko kako. Ino lelo utegule kafuko kako.”<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Muvina vake akamulonjelaje kuta, Heve uli mutantsi mubi na mugata, un'tsela kuta heni mbetaga hala ho sintsayalite, na ndundaga hala ho sintsatagalitse. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Waganikaga kukavika kafuko kangu ku benji, na heni kota hino fyo mbutsile ntsikakutegula kafuko kangu na fwayida yangu. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Lelo, mumusukule kafuko iko mukamupele yula munya fila fifuko kumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kwasawuli munu yoyuve yo anguchikolela katsi chila cho ntsimugavye uyo ngumuwila na chinji, nayo akuva nafyo fyolofu. Lechelelo munu yula yo sinambe achikolele katsi chinu chila chidodo cho ntsimugavye, ngumusukula na chila cho anacho. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Nanye mumutotse uyo mutantsi mubi, kono kokuna jitsa na chivembo na kugwegwetsula mino kwasawuli ya ng'odeko.”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuhigo wa wudugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Yesu akalongaje kuta, “Luvala lo akutsa Mwana va Munu kota Muntsajila hamwe na vatantsi veka va kilanga va Mulungu, iho ho akikala mwilanga mu chigoda chake cha Wuntsajila kuno mwene yo Muntsajila. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Vanu va inyi tseka vakukong'ana halutalo hake, nayo akuvabagula kota hila mudimi fyo atsibagulaga ng'olo na mene. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Akutsivika ng'olo kulubali lwake lwa kwililo na mene akutsivika kulubali lwake lwa kwichiji. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Iho ho Mutwa akuvalonjela vala yovali lubali lwake lwa kwililo kuta, Mutse henye yo mutambichilwe na Dada vangu, muwuhale wuntsajila wo wavisilwe kwasawuli yenyu kuhuma hala inyi hoyavaga ying'acha kuwumbwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kwasawuli hontsavaga na ntsala henye mwamelye chilyo, hontsavaga na ng'alu mwamelye malenga ntsang'weye, na hontsavaga ntsi mujentsi mwandibulitse. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Hala hontsavaga ntsilihela myenda mwafwisile myenda, na hontsavaga ntsimutamwa mwanamise, na hontsavaga mu nyumba ya wuwopwa mwatsitse kunjendela. <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Ihyo vala wo van'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu ho vakumujibula muntsajila kuta, Mutwa, hanili twakuwene una ntsala na kukupela chilyo, na hanili howavaga na ng'alu twakupelye malenga? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Hanili hotukakuwene uli mujentsi na twakulibulitse, awu hanili howavaga ulihela mwenda tukakufwikaje? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Hanili hotukakuwene uli mutamwa tukakutamisaje, awu hanili howavaga muwopwa tukatsaje kukujendela? <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Yula Mutwa akuvajibula, Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, chila chinu cho mwamuditye yumwe va vang'olotsangu wo vam'bedalwa, mwanditye heni.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Kaha akuvalonjela vala vanu wovali lubali lwake lwa kwichiji, Muheje halutalo hangu henye yo mukotwiche! Mubite ku moto gwa siku tseka go sigutsimikaga, go gwavisilwe kwasawuli ya Lihoka hamwe na vatantsi vake. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kwasawuli ntsali na ntsala henye simwamelye chilyo, kaha ntsali na ng'alu henye simwamelye malenga, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />hala hontsali mujentsi simwandibulitse, kaha hotsavaga mutamwa henye simwanamise, na ntsali mu muwopwa henye simwatsitse kunjendela.”<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Ihyo nawo vakumujibula, Mutwa, hanili ho tukakuwene una ntsala, awu una ng'alu awu wuli mujentsi, awu ulihela myenda, awu mutamwa, awu uli mu wuwopwa, hetwe situkatsitse kukutanga?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />“Nayo akuvalonjela, Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, hila fyo mwalemile kumuditila ndongwa itso yumwe va vala yo vabedalwaga, mwalemile kunditila heni. <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Ihyo iwo vakudibulwa ku ng'odeko ya siku tseka tso tsigaya wudugo, lechelelo vala wo vadisile kota fyo an'gana Mulungu vakubita mu wumi wo wugaya wudugo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Mupanjo gwa kumukopola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Maliko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Lukasi 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso tseka, akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake kuta, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Muntsela kuta tsisije siku tsivili hela ili kuve na liwungo lya Pasaka, na Mwana va Munu akutawulwa kwa vatelani ili avambwe mumusalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ihyo vatawula nambiko vavina hamwe na vavina va Vayawudi, vakitang'anaje hamwe mu nyumba ya wuntsajila ya muvina va vatawula nambiko yo anchemwa Kayafwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Vakapangaje hila fyo vakumubata Yesu kwa lufiho ili vamukopole. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Lechelelo vakalamulaje kuta lulongwa ulu silun'ganika lukoleche ha chipindi cha liwungo, ili kuleche kuhumila chitika hagati ha vanu.<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu am'boholelwa mafuta ku Betsaniya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu hoavaga ku muji gwa Betsaniya, mu nyumba ya Simoni yo avaga na wutamwa wa wububa, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />mudala yumwe yo avaga na supa yo yina mafuta ga galama ngomi, akabitaje hala ha metsa hoavaga Yesu ankulya, akamuboholelaje mafuta gala kumutwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Vadahitswa vake hovavaga kuwona hila vakavipaje na kulonga, “Yachichi hasala yeka yino? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Mafuta gano gakakugutswa kwa magobole molofu, na magobole igo vakakupelwa vanu vatsunwa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu akatselaje cho vahotsaga, ihyo akavalonjelaje kuta, “Kwasawuli yachi mungumutifya mudala yuno? Mwene yuno anditye lulongwa lunofu ndalahela. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Vatsunwa munawo siku tseka, lechelelo heni singuva hamwe na henye siku tseka. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Mudala yuno amboholye mafuta gano mu muvili ili ambiche chang'ani kwasawuli ya siku ya kutsikwa kwangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, kono kokuve ko vakuvikula Ndongwa Nofu, na lulongwa luno lo adisile mudala yuno lukutambulwa kwa kumwiwuka mwene.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda angumugaluka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10">Maliko 14:10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lukasi 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Ihyo Yuda Isikaliyote yumwe va vala vadahitswa kumi na vavili, akabitaje kwa vavina va vatawula nambiko, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />na kuvalonjela kuta, “Mukumela chinu chachi manyi ntsivaletele Yesu?” Vakamuvalilaje vipande salasini fya madini ga fetsa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kuhuma luvala ulo Yuda akantsaje kusaka hila fyo akumusindika Yesu kwawo.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankulya chilyo cha Pasaka hamwe na vadahitswa vake.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Lukasi 22:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Siku ndongola hoyavaga ying'acha kufika siku ya mikate jo sijivisilwe hamila, vadahitswa vake vakabitaje hoali Yesu na kumuputsa, “Un'gana kwiya ko tukakuvichile chang'ani chilyo cha Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Mwene Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mubite ku muji kwa mulume yumwe mukamulonjele, Mudahitsi anlonga hino, sala yangu yilihabehi, ngutsa kwa heve hamwe na vadahitswa vangu kulya Pasaka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Vadahitswa vakaditaje kota fyo avalajitse Yesu, vakavikaje chang'ani chilyo cha Pasaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Hokwavaga kufika hamihe, Yesu akikalisaje hamwe na vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili ili valye. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Nawo hovavaga vankulya, Yesu akalongaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli, yumwe yo mulihamwe akungaluka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Vadahitswa vakawonaje wusungu ndalahela, vakantsaje kumuputsa kuta, “Mutwa, mbe, nguva heni?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Yula yo akutsangitsa hamwe na heni mu bakuli uyo yo akungaluka. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Ena, Mwana va Munu am'bita kufwa kota Mandiko ga Mulungu fyo gandikwe. Lechelelo akudutsa munu yula yo akumugaluka Mwana va Munu. Yikakuva chiba akaave siakakuleleka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda yo angumugaluka, akamuputsaje, “Mudahitsi! Mbe, nguva heni?” Yesu akamujibulaje, “Heve ulontsile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilyo cha Mutwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lukasi 22:14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Hovavaga vankulya, Yesu akategulaje mukate, akamulumbaje Mulungu akamegasaje na kuvapela vadahitswa vake na kuvalonjela, “Mutegule mulye, ugu go muvili gwangu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Kaha akategulaje chikombe cha difwayi, akamulumbaje Mulungu akavapelaje vadahitswa vake na kuvalonjela kuta, “Mutegule mung'we nyeka difwayi yino. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Kwasawuli iyi yo danda ya heni yo yikulajila kuta lilagano lino lya Mulungu na vanu vake lyo lya wukweli, yo yim'bohoka kwasawuli ya kuvahumya vanu wolofu mu ndongwa tsawo ntsibi. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, singuwila kung'wa difwayi ya mutsabibu mbaka siku yila ho ngung'wa difwayi ntsipya hamwe na henye mu Wuntsajila wa Dada vangu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Hovavaga kusinda kwimba lwimbo, vakawukaje na kubita ku chidunda cha mitseyituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga kuta Petulo akumukana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lukasi 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Chilo cha munyi guno, henye nyeka mukumbilima na kundeka, kwasawuli yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">Ngumutova mudimi na chipinga cha ng'olo chikupwiling'ana. <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Lechelelo ho nguvakutsilipuka, nguvalongola kubita ku muji gwa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petulo akamupitulaje kuta, “Nayivaje veka vakuleche, heni singuhogola kukuleka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ntsingukulonjela wukweli kuta, chilo chichinago ntsogolo hoyikuva ying'acha kuvika, heve ukung'ana kadatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petulo akalongaje, “Nayivaje yin'ganika ntsifwe, singukukana.” Vala vadahitswa vanji nawo vakalongaje hihilaga.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ansuka kuko ku Gesemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lukasi 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Ihyo Yesu akabitaje hamwe na vadahitswa vake mu chinyungu cha Getisemane, akavalonjelaje, “Mwikale hano heni ntsim'bita kula kusuka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Akavategulaje Petulo hamwe na vana vavili va Tsebedayo, akantsaje kuva na wususutafu na kugatsika. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Ihyo akavalonjelaje, “Ntsina wusungu wukomi mu numbula mbaka ntsili habehi na kufwa. Mwikalaje miho hamwe na heni.” <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Lelo akabitaje halutalo chidogo, akagwaje kwa kufugama na kusuka, “Dada vangu, manyi yin'ganika unyetsele chikombe chino, lechelelo si kota fyo fyontsin'gana heni ila kota fyo un'gana heve.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Akabitaje kwa vala vadahitswa vake, akavafikaje vavasise. Akamulonjelaje Petulo, “Ulemilwe, kikala miho hamwe na heni nambe kwa lisala limwe hela? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Muvaje miho hamwe na kusala, muleche kwinjila mumajetso. Numbula yiganaga kudita, lechelelo muvili gulemwaga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Akabitaje kaha lwa kavili kusuka, “Dada vangu, manyi yin'ganika chikombe chino cha ng'odeko ndeche kuching'wela, lechelelo chikwilaje cho un'gana hene.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Akabitaje kaha, akavafikaje vavasise, kwasawuli miho gawo gavaga kabatiche na tulo. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Lelo akavalekaje na kubita kusuka lwa kadatu, akalongaje ndongwa tsitsilaga. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Kaha akabitaje kwa vadahitswa vake na kuvaputsa, “Mbe, mung'acha muvasise na kwesela? Mulave! Sala mwanga yifisile, Mwana va Munu akibatika na vanu wo van'dita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Mulamuche tubite. Mulave! Ankutsa yula yo akungaluka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu am'batika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lukasi 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Lelo Yesu hoavaga anlonga ndongwa itso, luvala lulo akatsaje Yuda, yumwe va vala vadahitswa kumi na vavili. Akatsitse hamwe na vanu wolofu vanya nyaladi na ndumbi yo vatumilwe na vavina va vatawula nambiko na vavina va Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yula yo aganile kumugaluka Yesu, avaga avapelye ndajilo kuta, “Yula munu yo ngumusamusa kwa kumukumbanitsa, uyo yo mukumubata.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Lelo Yuda akamuhejelelaje Yesu, na kumulonjela, “Hwewuli Mudahitsi!” Kaha akamukumbanitsaje. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Bee, muyangu udite cho utsitse kudita.” Ihyo vala vanu vakatsaje na kumubata Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Munu yumwe va vala wo vavaga hamwe na Yesu, akasomolaje waladi wake na akamuhutulaje lipulichilo mutantsi va muvina va vatawula nambiko. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Ihyo Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Pilule waladi wako mu yala, kwasawuli munu yoyuve yo akitova kwa waladi, uyo akukopolwa kwa waladi. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Mbe, sinambe mutsele kuta fuluche ntsimusuche Dada vangu ananje, nayo luvala lulu akakundetela fipinga kumi na fivili fya vatantsi va Kilanga? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Lechelelo gakukwila chinya ndawuli Mandiko ga Mulungu go gan'ganika gakwile?” <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje vala vanu wolofu wo vamubite kuta, “Mbe, mutsitse kumbata na nyaladi na ndumbi kota tsi muwumiyani? Chila siku tsavaga mu Nyumba ya Mulungu ntsin'dahitsa lechelelo simukimbite. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Lechelelo itsi ndongwa tseka tsihumye ili gakwile Mandiko ga valoli va Mulungu.” Ihyo vadahitswa vake veka vakamulekaje na kubilima.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu halutalo ha libalatsa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-71">Lukasi 22:54-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-24">Yohana 18:13-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Lelo vala vanu yovamubite Yesu vakamusindikaje ku nyumba ya mutawula nambiko muvina yo achemwaga Kayafwa, uko kovali vakavakong'ine na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na vavina va Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Petulo amufwataga Yesu kwa kutali mbaka mu luga lwa muvina va vatawula nambiko. Akinjilaje mu nyumba hamwe na vimilitsi ili alole ndongwa itso fyo tsikuva. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Lelo vavina veka va vatawula nambiko na Libalatsa lyeka vakavasakaje wusayidi wa wudesi ili vamukopole Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Lechelelo sivapasile wusayidi wowuve, na yivaje vahumye vasayidi wolofu va wudesi. Hawudugo vakahumilaje vasayidi vavili va wudesi, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />nawo vakalongaje, “Munu uyo alontsile kuta, Fuluche ngumulanje Nyumba ya Mulungu na kuyitsenga kaha kwa siku tsidatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Ihyo Muvina va vatawula nambiko akimaje hagati ha vanu veka na kumuputsa Yesu, “Kwasawuli yachi sinambe ulonje chinu chochive? Mbe, sinambe uhuliche vanu vano fyo vangukuhiga?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Lechelelo Yesu akakatukaje myee! Muvina va vatawula nambiko akamulonjelaje, “Ntsingukulahitsa kwa Mulungu yo mumi, utulonjele kuta heve yo Chilisito Mukulusi, Mwana va Mulungu!” <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu akamujibulaje, “Ulontsile heve! Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjela, kuhuma sambi mukumuwona Mwana va Munu ichite lubali lwa kwililo lwa Mutwa munya wuvetso, fyo ankutsa kuhuma kilanga mu mafuluka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ihyo Muvina va vatawula nambiko, akademulaje myenda jake kulajila kuta avifile na kulonga kuta, “Angumuliga Mulungu, lelo tun'gana wusahidi wachi kaha? Sambi muhuliche fyo amulitsile Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Henye mun'wona ndawuli?” Vene vakalongaje, “An'ganika kukopolwa!” <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Kaha vakamufunyilaje mati ku miho, na kumutova makofi, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />na kumulonjela kuta, “Ulagule, nani yo akutofile?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo angumukana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lukasi 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petulo ho avaga ichite hivala mu luvigo. Duve mutantsi yumwe mudala akabitaje kwa Petulo na kumulonjela kuta, “Heve nave uka hamwe na Yesu va ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Lechelo Petulo akakanaje halutalo ha veka akalongaje, “Sinambe ntsele cho unlonga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Hoavaga anhuma kivala, halwitsi lwa luvigo akitang'anaje na mutantsi yunji muhintsa akamuwonaje, akavalonjelaje vanu wovavaga hala kuta, “Uyuno nayo aka hamwe na Yesu va ku Natsaleti.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petulo akakanaje kaha kwa kilaha na kulonga, “Heni sintsimutsele munu uyo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Luvala lulo vanu wo vavaga vimile hono hala vakabitaje hoali Petulo na kumulonjela, “Nachene heve nave uli yumwe vawo, mana nambe ndonga yako yingukutambutsa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Iho Petulo akantsaje kwikotola na kwilaha akalongaje kuta, “Sintsimutsele munu uyo!” Luvala lulo ntsogolo yikavikaje. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Petulo akiwukaje ndongwa tso avaga alontsilwe na Yesu kuta, “Hala ntsogolo hoying'acha kuvika ukung'ana kadatu.” Duve akahumaje kivala, akavembaje ndalahela kwa wusungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ansindikwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Lukasi 23:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Hokwavaga kufika hamilawu, vavina va vatawula nambiko veka hamwe na vavina va Vayawudi, vakalonganaje ili vamukopole Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Vakamuwopaje pingu na kumutegula, vakamusindikaje kwa Pilato, yo avaga muvina va muji.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda angitumbika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Ihyo Yuda yo avaga amugaluche Yesu, hoavaga kuwona kuta Yesu mwanga vamuhijite kukopolwa, numbula yake yikamuhigaje akapilulaje fila fipande salasini fya madini ga fwetsa kwa vavina va vatawula nambiko na vavina va Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Akavalonjelaje, “Ndisile lulongwa lubi kwa kumutawula munu yo alihela lukani loluve.” Lechelelo vene vakalongaje, “Lulongwa ulo lukututanga chichi hetwe? Ukudaha heve” <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Mwene Yuda akafidibulaje fila fipande fya fwetsa mugati mwa Nyumba ya Mulungu, akahumaje kivala, akabitaje kikopola kwa kitumbika. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Vavina va vatawula nambiko vakategulaje fila fipande fya madini ga fyetsa, vakalongaje kuta, “Siyo finofu ndaya kuhantsa fwetsa tsino hamwe na sadaka tsinji, kwasawuli ifi fipande fya kumukopola munu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Lelo vakapatanaje na kulamula kuta vakagule mugunda gwa munu muwufi na go guna lilongo lya kuwufila fiya, guve hono ha kutsichila vanu vajentsi. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Icho cho chivalo cha mugunda gula kuchemwa mbaka sambi mugunda gwa danda. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ihyo ndongwa tsa muloli Yelemiya tsikakwilaje kuta, “Vategwe fipande salasini fya madini ga fwetsa, kota hila fyo vavaga vapatine na munu yula kumuhomba.” <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Nago magobole igo vakagulilaje mugunda gunya lilongo lya kuwufila fiya.<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato angumuwutsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Lukasi 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Vakamwimyaje Yesu halutalo ha muvina va muji. Yula muvina akamuputsaje, “Heve yo Muntsajila va Vayawudi?” Yesu akamujibulaje, “Heve yo ulontsile ihyo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Lechelelo vavina va vatawula nambiko hovavaga kumuhiga siakalontsile lulongwa loluve. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ihyo Pilato akamuwutsaje kuta, “Mbe, sinambe uhuliche ndongwa tso vangukuhiga?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Lechelelo Yesu siakalontsile nambe lulongwa lumwe, mbaka muvina yula nayo akapomokaje ndalahela.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anhigwa kukopolwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lukasi 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Lelo kwavaga na ntsovelo tsa kumudindulila muwopwa yumwe yo akuhagulwa na vanu chipindi cha liwungo lya Pasaka. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Luvala ulo kwavaga na muwopwa yumwe yo avaga mutambulwa ndalahela kwasawuli ya ndongwa ntsibi tso aditaga, yo achemwaga Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ihyo vanu ho vakakong'ine hamwe, Pilato akavaputsaje, “Mun'gana ntsimudindulile nani, mungumugana Balaba awu Yesu yo anchemwa Chilisito?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pilato alontsile ihyo kwasawuli atselaga kuta, vamuletite kwa mwene kwasawuli ya mbafya hela. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato hoavaga ichite mu chigoda cha kuhijila, mudala vake akamusindichilaje wujumbe kuta, “Uleche kumudita lulogwa lubi loluve munu yuno, kwasawuli hachilo ng'odiche ndalahela mu mbilo kwasawuli yake. <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Lechelelo vatawula nambiko vavina na vavina va Vayawudi vakavakokaje vanu kuta, vamusuche Pilato amudindulile Balaba, na Yesu an'ganika akopolwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Nayo Pilato akavaputsaje, Mun'gana ntsivadindulile nani?” Vakalongaje, “Balaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato akavalonjelaje, “Ntsimudite ndawuli Yesu yo anchemwa Chilisito?” Vanu veka vakalongaje, “Avambwe mumusalaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato akawilaje kuvaputsa, “Kwasawuli ya chichi? Adisile wubi wachi?” Lechelelo vene vakendelelaje kuyova kuta, “Umuvambe mumusalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato hoavaga kulemwa kudita lulongwa loluve, lechelelo ho chavaga chin'kwantsa chitika hela, akategulaje malenga na kukalava mawoko halutalo ha vanu na kulonga kuta, “Manyi henye, heni ntsili muduhu kwa lulongwa lwa kumukopola munu yuno!” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Vanu veka vakalongaje, “Nongwa yino ya kumukopola Yesu yivaje kwa hetwe na kwa vana vetu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Lelo Pilato akamudindulilaje Balaba, na akalajitsaje vimilitsi vake vamutove Yesu mikotya, akumutawulaje kwa vanu vamuvambe mumusalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vimilitsi vangumuditila Yesu mbedatsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Yohana 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ihyo vimilitsi vala va Pilato akamutegulaje Yesu mbaka mu luvigo lwa nyumba ya muvina va Chilumi yo yinchemwa Pulayitoliyo, chipinga cheka cha vimilitsi chikamukong'asichilaje Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Vakamuwopolaje myenda jake na kumufwika mwenda mudung'u. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Kaha vakabotaje kofiya ya mifwa na kumufwika kumutwi. Vakamupelaje ng'weku muliwoko lyake lililo na kufugama halutalo hake kwa mbedatsi kuno vanlonga, “Kamwene be, Muntsajila va Vayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Vakamufunyilaje mati vakategulaje yila ng'weku na kumutova tova nayo kumutwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Hovavaga kumubedala, vakamuwopolaje mwenda gula mudung'u na kumufwika myenda jake. Ihyo vakamusindikaje ili vamuvambe mumusalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anvambwa mu musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lukasi 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Hovavaga vam'bita, vakitang'anaje na munu yumwe va Kulene yo achemwaga Simoni, nawo vakamulatsimitsaje itwiche musalaba gula gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Vakafikaje hono ho hanchemwa Goligota, chinya kutijila “Hono ha lipala lya mutwi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Vakamupelaje Yesu difwayi yo yihahile. Lechelelo Yesu ho avaga kuyijela, akalemaje kung'wa. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Hovavaga kumuvamba mumusalaba, hambele vakagavanaje myenda jake kwa kutova simbi. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Kaha vakikalaje kumwimilila iho ha musalaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Hilanga ha musalaba gula havaga handikwe ndongwa tsa kumuhiga kuta, “UYU YO YESU MUNTSAJILA VA VAYAWUDI.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Vawumiyani vavili vavaga vavambitwe hamwe na Yesu. Yumwe musalaba gwa lubali lwa ichiji na yumwe musalaba gwa lubali lwa ililo. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Vanu wo vavaga vanlutila hono iho vamuligaga Yesu na kuno vatsuntsa mitwi jawo na kulonga kuta, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Heve siwavaga ungidutsa kuta ukuyigumulanga Nyumba ya Mulungu na kuyitsenga kwa siku tsidatu? Lelo wikuluse! Lelo manyi heve uli Mwana va Mulungu, wiche mumusalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Hihyo nawo vavina va vatawula nambiko na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa hamwe na vavina va Vayawudi nawo vakamubedelaje kuta, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Avakuluse vanji, lechelelo anlemwa kwikulusa mwene! Mwene yo Muntsajila va Vayawudi? Lelo iche mu musalaba na hetwe tukumutumba. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Amutumbilaga Mulungu lelo Mulungu amukuluse manyi kweli angumugana, kwasawuli avaga alontsile kuta, Heni yo Mwana va Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Hihila nawo wo vavaga vavambitwe hamwe na Yesu vakamuligaje.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antajika mu musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lukasi 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kuhuma sasita ya hamunyi jitsa likayigubikaje inyi yeka. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Hoyavaga kufika satisa akakolaje fikami, “Eloyi Eloyi lama Sabachitani?” Chinya kutijila “Mulungu vangu, Mulungu vangu, mbona undesile?” <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Lechelelo vanu vanji wo vavaga vimile hono hala, hovavaga kuhulika ihyo vakalongaje kuta, “Angumuchema muloli Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Muyawo yumwe akabilimaje kuleta siponji na kuyitsabika mu sichi, akayivikaje mu lidenje na kumupela ang'we. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Vanu vanji vakalongaje, “Leche tulole manyi Eliya akutsa kumukulusa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Ihyo Yesu akavembaje kaha kwa litsi likomi, akafwaje. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Luvala lulo lipantsila lya Nyumba ya Mulungu likatulikaje kavili luhuma kuchanya mbaka hasi, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />makabuli gakagubukaje na vanu wo vafweye kuno vangumutumbila Mulungu vakatsilipulwaje. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Vakahumaje mu makabuli, na hoavaga kutsilipuka Yesu vakinjilaje ku Muji Muhagulwa na Mulungu na vakavahumilaje vanu wolofu.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi hamwe na vala wo vavaga hono hala hoavaga kufiwona fyo fihumye, akamutsumitsaje Mulungu na kulonga, “Wukweli munu yuno aditaga kota fyo an'gana Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Hono iho havaga na vadala wolofu yo valolaga kwa kutali. Iwo wo vakavamufwatite Yesu kuhuma ku muji gwa Galilaya nawo vamutangaga. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Yumwe vawo avaga Maliya va ku Magidalena, na Maliya yuvawo Yakobo na Yosefu, hamwe na yuvawo va Tsebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antsikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lukasi 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Hoyavaga kufika hamihe, akatsaje munu yumwe mufuchifu yo achemwaga Yusufu va ku muji gwa Alimataya, uyo nayo avaga mudahitswa va Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Akabitaje kwa Pilato kugusuka muvili gwa Yesu, na Pilato akalajitsaje vamupele. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Ihyo Yusufu akagutegulaje muvili, akagupilingitsaje sanda ya galama ngomi ntselu tswee! <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Akagutsikaje mu kabuli yo avaga ahongwe mwene mu litalave. Kaha akavikaje liganga likomi halutalo ha lwitsi lwa kabuli, akawukaje. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliya va kuhuma muji gwa Magidalena, na yula Maliya yunji vavaga vichite habehi na hono iho vanlava kabuli.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likabuli lya Yesu likwimililwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Hamilawu iyage yo yavaga siku ya Weselo, vavina va vatawula nambiko, na Vafwalisayo vakabitaje kwa Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />na kumulonjela “Muvina, twiwuche kuta yula mudesi hoavaga mumi avaga alontsile kuta, Hoyikufika siku ya kadatu ngutsilipuka. <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Lelo ulajitse kuta kabuli yimililwe mbaka siku tsidatu, ili vadahitswa vake vafuluche vatse vaguhitse muvili gwake na kuvalonjela vanu kuta atsilipwiche. Wudesi uwo wa wudugo wukuva wubi ndalahela kulutila wula wa wulongola.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato akavalonjelaje, “Henye munawo vimilitsi, ale mubite mukimilile fyo mukuvetsa henye.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ihyo vakabitaje na vimilitsi ili kwimilila nachene kabuli, vakalitovaje muhuli liganga lya mu mulango gwa kabuli, na vakalekaje baho vimilitsi.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kutsilipuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lukasi 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Hoyavaga kulutila Siku ya Weselo, hamilawu ya siku ya wulongolo wa wichi, Maliya va ku muji gwa Magidalena na Yula Maliya yunji vakabitaje kuyilava kabuli. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Simusika kukavaje na likakamo likomi lya inyi, Mutantsi va kilanga va Mutwa, akikaje kuhuma kilanga na kulihetsa lila liganga lyo lyavaga ligubiche likabuli na kulivika halubali, akikalilaje. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Mutatsi uyo va kilanga kumiho kwake kwavalaga kota wumeme na mwenda gwake gwavaga mwelu tswee! Kota nyiwi. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Vala vimilitsi va kabuli vakavaje na muloto ndalahela, vakavaje kota vafweye. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Lechelelo yula mutantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu akavalonjelaje vadala vala kuta, “Mulekaje kuva na muloto, kwasawuli ntsin'tsela kuta mungumusaka Yesu yo avambitwe mumusalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Alihaduhu hano kwasawuli atsilipuche kota fyo alontsile, mutse mulole hono ho aka avasise. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Lelo mwangufitse mubite mukavalonjele vadahitswa vake kuta, Atsilipuche, na sambi avalongwe kula ku muji gwa Galilaya. Uko ko mukumuwona, Ale, heni mwanga ntsivalonje.” <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ihyo vala vadala vakawukaje hala ha kabuli kuno vana muloto na wuhechelelo, vakabilimaje ili kuvalonjela vadahitswa vake. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Luvala lulo Yesu akitang'anaje nawo na kuvasamusa, “Kamwene!” Vala vadala vakamuhejelelaje vakamubataje magulu gake, vakamufugamilaje. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muleche kuva na muloto, Mubite mukavalonjele vang'olo tsangu vabite ku Galilaya, uko ko vakumbona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vimilitsi vanlonga gogahumye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Vala vadala hovavaga vam'bita, vimilitsi vamwe va kabuli yila vakabitaje ku muji kuvalonjela vavina va vatawula nambiko ndongwa tseka tsotsihumye. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Lelo vakakong'anaje hamwe na vavina, na hovavaga valongine vakavapelaje vala vimilitsi va kabuli magobole molofu <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />na kuvalonjela kuta, “Henye mukulonga kuta vadahitswa vake vakatsitse hachilo na kumuhitsa hala hetwe ho twavavaga tuvasise. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Manyi lulongwa luno lufiche kwa mutavala venyu, hetwe tukulongana nayo na kuvahetsela muhwehwe na henye simukupata lulongwa lubi loluve.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Lelo vala vimilitsi vakategulaje gala magobole na kudita kota hila fyo vavaga valajitswe. Lulongwa ulo lutagalye kwa Vayawudi mbaka sambi.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahumila vadahitswa vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lukasi 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Vala vahidatswa kumi na yumwe vakafikaje ku Galilaya na kubita ku chila chidunda cho ali avalajitse Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Hovavaga kumuwona vakamufugamilaje, na lechelelo vanji vavaga na muhwehwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu akahejelelaje habehi na kuvalonjela, “Melitwe wuvina weka wa kutavala Kilanga na mu inyi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Kwasawuli yino, mubite kwa vanu va inyi tseka mukavadite vave vadahitswa vangu, kuno mukuvabatitsa kwa Litawa lya Dada, na Mwana, na lya Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Muvadahitse kibata ndongwa tseka tso ntsivalajitse henye. Heni nguva hamwe na henye siku tseka mbaka hawudugo gwa fipindi.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>